<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Mar Ariyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samuel Mar Ariyo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi owinjo tho mar Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1"/>Bangʼ kane Saulo osetho, Daudi noduogo koa e lweny mane oloyoe jo-Amalek mi nonindo Ziklag ndalo ariyo. <verse eid="2SA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2"/>Chiengʼ mar adek ngʼato nobiro koa e kambi mar Saulo korwako lewni moyiech to wiye otimo buru, kane ochopo ir Daudi nokulore nyaka piny komiye duongʼ.<verse eid="2SA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3"/>Daudi nopenje niya, “Ia kanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Nodwoke niya, “Atony kawuok e kambi mar jo-Israel.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4"/>Daudi nopenjo niya, “Wachnane, angʼo manotimore?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Nodwoke niya, “Ji noringo kawuok e lweny. Ngʼenygi nonegi kendo Saulo gi Jonathan wuode bende otho.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5"/>Eka Daudi nowachone wuowi mane okelone wach niya, “Ere kaka ingʼeyo ni Saulo gi wuode Jonathan osetho?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6"/>Wuowino nodwoke niya, “Ne oyudo ka an e got Gilboa kendo ne aneno Saulo kochwowore gi tongʼe, ka geche lweny kod joidhgi mane lawe ne chiegni juke.” <verse eid="2SA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7"/>Kane olokore monena, noluonga, mine apenje ni, Angʼo midwaro mondo atim?<verse eid="2SA 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8"/>“Nopenja ni, ‘In ngʼa?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Ne adwoke ni, ‘An ja-Amalek.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9"/>“Eka nowachona ni, ‘Sud ira ka mondo inega! Nikech awinjo rem malit to ngimana pod nitie.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10"/>“Omiyo ne asudo bute mi anege, nikech ne angʼeyo ni kaka ne osepodho ne ok onyal chungʼ malo mi otony. Ne akawo osimbo mar loch mane ni e wiye gi bangli mane ni e kor bade kendo asekelogi ka ni ruodha.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11"/>Eka Daudi gi joma nenikode nomako lepgi moyiecho. <verse eid="2SA 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12"/>Negikuyo ka giywak kendo ka giriyo kech nyaka ochopo odhiambo, ka giywago Saulo gi wuode Jonathan, to gi jolweny mag Jehova Nyasaye to gi jo-Israel, nikech ne oseneg-gi gi ligangla.<verse eid="2SA 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13"/>Daudi nowacho ni rawera mane okelone wach niya, “In jakanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Nodwoke niya, “An wuod jadak ma ja-Amalek.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14"/>Daudi nopenje niya, “Angʼo momiyo ne ok iluor mar tingʼo badi kinego ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15"/>Eka Daudi noluongo achiel kuom joge mowachone niya, “Dhi inege!” Omiyo ngʼatno nochwowe motho. <verse eid="2SA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16"/>Nimar Daudi nosewachone niya, “Rembi obedi e wiyi iwuon. Dhogi ema osebedo janeno mari ka iwacho ni, ‘Asenego ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oywago Saulo gi Jonathan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17"/>Daudi nochwogo wend ywak miywagogo Saulo gi wuode Jonathan, <verse eid="2SA 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18"/>kendo nochiko mondo opuonj jo-Juda wend ywak mar atungʼ mondiki e Kitabu mar Jasher kama:<verse eid="2SA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19"/>“Yaye Israel, jogi moluor oriere piny konegi e gode maboyo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Mano kaka roteke osepodho.<verse eid="2SA 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20"/>“Kik iwach wachni e piny Gath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">kik ihul wachni e yore man Ashkelon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">nono to dimi nyi jo-Filistia bed moil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">bende dimi nyi joma ok oter nyangu bed moil.<verse eid="2SA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21"/>“Yaye gode mag Gilboa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">mad ibed maonge thoo kata koth,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">kata puothe machiego cham michiwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Nimar kanyo ema ne odwanye kuodi mag joma rateke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">kuodi mag Saulo, tinde ok wir gi mo.<verse eid="2SA 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22"/>Koa kuom remb joma nonegi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">koa kuom ringre joma rateke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">atungʼ mar Jonathan ne ok odwogo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">ligangla mar Saulo ne ok odwogo nono.<verse eid="2SA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23"/>“Saulo gi Jonathan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">ne oher kendo ne gin joma longʼo kane gingima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">kendo e kinde thogi ne ok gipogore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Negiringo matek maloyo ongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">kendo ne gitek maloyo sibuor.<verse eid="2SA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24"/>“Yaye nyi Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">ywaguru Saulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">mane orwakou gi lewni makwar kendo marep-rep,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">mane oduso lepu gi gik molos gi dhahabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25"/>“Mano kaka joma rateke osetho e lweny!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonathan onindo konegi e godeu maboyo.<verse eid="2SA 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26"/>Aywagi malit, Jonathan omera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ne ageni ahinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Herani koda ne lich miwuoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">moloyo hera mar mon.<verse eid="2SA 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27"/>“Mano kaka joma rateke osetho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Kendo gigegi mag lweny osetieki!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi owir mondo obed ruodh Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko Daudi nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach niya, “Bende anyalo dhi e achiel kuom miech Juda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Jehova Nyasaye ne odwoke niya, “Dhiyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Daudi nopenjo niya, “Adhi kanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Jehova Nyasaye ne odwoke niya, “Dhi Hebron.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2"/>Omiyo Daudi nodhi kuno gi monde ariyo, Ahinoam nyar Jezreel gi Abigael ma dhako ma chwore otho mane jaod Nabal ja-Karmel. <verse eid="2SA 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3"/>Daudi bende nodhi gi joma ne ni kode ka moro ka moro nigi joode, kendo negidak Hebron gi dalane. <verse eid="2SA 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4"/>Eka jo-Juda nobiro Hebron, kendo ne giwiro Daudi obedo ruodh dhood Juda kanyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Kane onyis Daudi ni jo-Jabesh Gilead ema ne oiko Saulo, <verse eid="2SA 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5"/>nooro joote ni jo-Jabesh Gilead mondo owachnegi niya, “Jehova Nyasaye mondo ogwedhu kuom timo tim ngʼwono ni Saulo ma ruodhu ka uike. <verse eid="2SA 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6"/>Mad Jehova Nyasaye otimnu ngʼwonone gi adierane makare, kata an bende abiro timonu tim ngʼwonono machal kamano nikech ma musetimo. <verse eid="2SA 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7"/>To koro sani beduru motegno kendo ma jochir, nimar Saulo ruodhu osetho, kendo dhood Juda osewira abed ruodhgi.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lweny e kind dhood Daudi gi dhood Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8"/>E kindeno noyudo ka Abner wuod Ner, jatend lwenj Saulo, osekawo Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo motere nyaka Mahanaim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9"/>Nokete ruodh Gilead, Ashuri gi Jezreel, to gi Efraim gi Benjamin kod Israel duto.<verse eid="2SA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10"/>Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo ne ja-higni piero angʼwen kano bedo ruodh Israel, nobedo ruoth kuom higni ariyo. Dhood Juda, to ne luwo Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11"/>Daudi nobedo ruodh dhood Juda kuom higni abiriyo, gi dweche auchiel kane en Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12"/>Abner wuod Ner, kaachiel gi jo-Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo, nowuok Mahanaim mi gidhi Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13"/>Joab wuod Zeruya gi jo-Daudi nodhi moromo kodgi e yawo man Gibeon. Negibet ka gingʼiyore jomoko koni to jomoko kocha.<verse eid="2SA 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14"/>Eka Abner nowachone Joab niya, “We yawuowi oa malo mondo omakre achingʼ gachingʼ e nyimwa ka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Joab nodwoko niya, “Kare gitim kamano.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15"/>Eka negia malo mokwan-gi mi giromo ji apar gi ariyo ma jo-Benjamin ma ruodhgi ne en Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo, to gi apar gariyo mag Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16"/>Negirado ka moro ka moro mako wadgi gi wiye eka ochwoyo ngʼetne gi ligangla; eka giduto negiruombore piny. Omiyo nochak kar lwenyno mane ni Gibeon ni Helkath Hazurim ma tiende ni paw ligangla.<verse eid="2SA 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17"/>Chiengʼno lweny ne ger ahinya, kendo joma ne nigi Daudi noloyo Abner gi jo-Israel.<verse eid="2SA 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18"/>Yawuot Zeruya adek ne gin Joab, Abishai gi Asahel. Koro Asahel ne tiende yot e ngʼwech mana ka mwanda. <verse eid="2SA 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19"/>Ne olawo Abner, ka ok obaro korachwich kata koracham kolawe alawa. <verse eid="2SA 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20"/>Abner nongʼiyo chien mopenjo niya, “Mano in, Asahel?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Modwoko niya, “Ee en an.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21"/>Eka Abner nowachone niya, “Bar korachwich kata koracham; mak achiel kuom yawuowigo mondo imaye gige mag lweny.” To Asahel notamore weyo lawe.<verse eid="2SA 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22"/>Abner nosiemo Asahel niya, “We lawa! En angʼo momiyo danegi? To katimo kamano, ere kaka dachungʼ e nyim Joab owadu?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23"/>To Asahel nodagi weyo lawe; mi Abner nochwowo ii Asahel gi tongʼ mi tongʼ nowuok yo ka ngʼee Asahel. Nogore piny kanyo mi otho gisano. Kendo ji duto nochungʼ ka gichopo kama Asahel nogore piny motho.<verse eid="2SA 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24"/>To Joab gi Abishai nolawo Abner, kendo ka chiengʼ ne podho, negichopo e got Ama, machiegni gi Gia e yo mochiko thim mar Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25"/>Eka jo-Benjamin nochungʼ bangʼ Abner. Negichokore e migepe kendo negiikore ne lweny ewi got.<verse eid="2SA 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26"/>Abner noluongo Joab matek kowacho niya, “Chuno ni ligangla biro neko nyaka chiengʼ koso? Donge ingʼeyo ni wachni biro kelo sigu? Biro kawo kinde maromo nade mondo ikwer jogi owe lawo owetegi?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27"/>Joab nodwoke niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Nyasaye mangima, ni ka dine ok iwuoyo, to jogi dodhi nyime gi lawo owetegi nyaka gokinyi.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28"/>Omiyo Joab nogoyo tungʼ mi ji duto nobiro mochungʼ, ne ok gimedo lawo jo-Israel, kata lweny bende ok ne gidhiyogo nyime.<verse eid="2SA 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29"/>Otienono duto Abner gi joge nowuotho ka gingʼado Araba. Negiyoro aora Jordan, negimedo dhi ka gikadho gwengʼ Bithron duto mi gichopo Mahanaim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30"/>Eka Joab noduogo koa lawo Abner mi ochoko joge duto kanyakla. Ji apar gochiko mag Daudi ne onge ka ok okwan Asahel. <verse eid="2SA 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31"/>To jo-Daudi nosenego jo-Benjamin mia adek gi piero auchiel mane nigi Abner. <verse eid="2SA 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32"/>Negitingʼo ringre Asahel mi giike e liend wuon-gi e Bethlehem. Eka Joab gi joge nowuotho otieno duto mi gichopo Hebron ka piny yawore.<verse eid="2SA 2:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1"/>Lweny mane ni e kind dhood Saulo gi dhood Daudi nodhi nyime kuom ndalo mangʼeny. Daudi nomedo bedo giteko ahinya, ka dhood Saulo to nomedo bedo manyap.<verse eid="2SA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2"/>Yawuowi mane Daudi onywolo ka en Hebron e magi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">Wuode makayo ne en Amnon wuod Ahinoam nyar Jezreel;<verse eid="2SA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3"/>mar ariyo ne en Kileab wuod Abigael ma dhako mane chwore otho mane jaod Nabal ja-Karmel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:3">mar adek ne en Abisalom wuod Maaka nyar Talmai ruodh Geshur;<verse eid="2SA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4"/>mar angʼwen ne en Adonija wuod Hagith;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:4">mar abich ne en Shefatia wuod Abital;<verse eid="2SA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5"/>mar auchiel ne en Ithream ma wuod chi Daudi miluongo ni Egla.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:5"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 3:5">Jogi duto Daudi nonywolo ka en Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abner odhi ir Daudi Hebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6"/>E ndalo mag lweny mane ni e kind dhood Saulo gi dhood Daudi, Abner nomedo bedo gi teko e dhood Saulo. <verse eid="2SA 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7"/>Saulo ne nigi dhako machielo ma nyinge Rizpa nyar Aiya. Kendo Ish-Boseth nopenjo Abner niya, “Marangʼo isedonjo e od wuora mi ikawo chiege miloko mari?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8"/>Abner ne iye owangʼ ahinya nikech wach mane Ish-Boseth owachone mine odwoke niya, “Kare aromra mana gi wich guok e kind Juda? Kawuononi abolora e bwo loch wuonu ma Saulo gi joode kod osiepene. Pok achiwi e lwet Daudi. To kata kamano, iketho nyinga ni atimo richo gi dhakoni! <verse eid="2SA 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9"/>Mad Nyasaye ngʼadne Abner bura, kata obed ni en bura matek machalo nade, ka diponi ok atimone Daudi gima Jehova Nyasaye nokwongʼore ka singone, <verse eid="2SA 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10"/>mi alok pinyruoth kagolo e dhood Saulo kendo kaguro motegno loch Daudi e Israel gi Juda chakre Dan nyaka Bersheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11"/>Ish-Boseth ok nohedhore wacho gimoro kendo ni Abner nikech noluore.<verse eid="2SA 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12"/>Eka Abner ne ooro joote mage moko ir Daudi mondo owach kama: “Mani en piny ngʼa? Los winjruok koda kendo abiro konyi kakelo Israel duto kuomi.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13"/>Daudi nowacho niya, “Mano ber. Abiro loso winjruok e kinda kodi. To gimoro achiel madwaro kuomi en; kik ibi e nyima ka ok ikelo Mikal nyar Saulo chiengʼ ma ibiro nena.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14"/>Eka Daudi nooro joote ir Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo konyise niya, “Miya Mikal chiega mane anywomo an awuon gi ringre jo-Filistia mia achiel.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15"/>Omiyo Ish-Boseth nogolo chik mondo ogole kuom Paltiel wuod Laish machuore. <verse eid="2SA 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16"/>Chwore to noluwo bangʼe kaywak nyaka gichopo Bahurim, eka Abner ne owachone niya, “Dog dala!” Mi nodok.<verse eid="2SA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17"/>Abner ne owuoyo gi jodong Israel kowacho niya, “Kuom kinde moko usebedo ka udwaro keto Daudi obed ruodhu.” <verse eid="2SA 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18"/>Koro sani timuru kamano! Nimar Jehova Nyasaye ne osingore ni Daudi ni, Ka akonyora gi jatichna Daudi abiro reso joga Israel oa e lwet Filistia kendo e lwet wasikgi duto.<verse eid="2SA 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19"/>Abner ne owuoyo gi jo-Benjamin en owuon. Eka ne odhi Hebron mondo onyis Daudi weche duto ma jo-Israel gi dhood Benjamin duto ne dwa timo. <verse eid="2SA 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20"/>Kane Abner gi ji piero ariyo mane obirogo ir Daudi ochopo Hebron, Daudi ne olosone nyasi mar chiemo kaachiel gi joge. <verse eid="2SA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21"/>Eka Abner ne owacho ni Daudi niya, “We mondo adhi piyo mondo achok jo-Israel duto ni ruodha ma ruoth, mondo giwinjre kodi, mondo ibed ruodhgi giduto kaka chunyi dwaro.” Omiyo Daudi ne oweyo Abner oa ire modhi gi kwe.<verse eid="2SA 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Joab onego Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22"/>Joge Daudi gi Joab noduogo koa pecho e sechego kendo negikelo gik mangʼeny moyaki. Abner to ne osewuok oweyo Daudi Hebron nikech Daudi ne oseweye thuolo mondo odhi, kendo noweye odhi gi kwe. <verse eid="2SA 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23"/>Kane Joab gi jolweny duto mane ni kode odonjo, ne owachne ni Abner wuod Ner ne osebiro ir ruoth, mi ruoth ne osemiye thuolo modhi, kendo bende nine osedhi gi kwe.<verse eid="2SA 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24"/>Omiyo Joab ne odhi ir ruoth mowachone niya, “Isetimo angʼoni? Ne, Abner ne obiro iri, to angʼo momiyo iweye odhi? Koro osedhi! <verse eid="2SA 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25"/>Ingʼeyo Abner wuod Ner; osebiro mondo owuondi kendo mondo onon kendo ongʼe kaka iwuotho mondo ongʼe gik moko duto ma itimo.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26"/>Joab ne owuok oweyo Daudi mi ooro joote mi olawo Abner, kendo ne gijuke ka en e soko man Sira mi giduoge. To Daudi ne ok ongʼeyo wachni. <verse eid="2SA 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27"/>Koro kane Abner osedwogo Hebron, Joab notere tenge e dhorangach; ka gima odwa wuoyo kode lingʼ-lingʼ. To kendo gikanyo, ema nochuloe kuor mar Asahel, mi Joab nochwowo iye motho.<verse eid="2SA 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28"/>Bangʼe ka Daudi nowinjo wachni, nowacho niya, “An kod pinyruodha wanabed maler e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka chiengʼ kuom remb Abner wuod Ner. <verse eid="2SA 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29"/>Mad rembe bed ewi Joab gi ewi dhood wuon-gi duto! Mad e dhood Joab kik bedi ni onge ngʼama nigi adhola machwer kata ja-dhoho kata ngʼama wuotho gi luth kata ngʼama inego gi ligangla kata ngʼama ochando chiemo.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30"/>Joab gi Abishai owadgi nonego Abner nikech nosenego Asahel mowadgi e lweny mane oked Gibeon.<verse eid="2SA 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31"/>Eka Daudi nowacho ni Joab gi ji duto mane ni kode niya, “Yiechuru lepu kendo rwakreuru gi lep ywak kendo wuothuru e nyim Abner ka uywak.” Ruoth Daudi owuon to nowuotho kaluwo joma otingʼo ringre Abner. <verse eid="2SA 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32"/>Abner ne oiki e piny Hebron, kendo ruoth noywak malit e liende. Ji duto bende noywak.<verse eid="2SA 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33"/>Ruoth nochwogo wend ywak ne Abner kama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Yaye bende ne onego Abner tho mana kaka ngʼama ofuwo tho?<verse eid="2SA 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34"/>Lweti ne ok otwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">tiendeni ne ok otwe gi ratege.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Isepodho mana kaka ngʼato podho e lwet joma richo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Kendo ji duto notugore ka ywage kendo.<verse eid="2SA 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35"/>Eka giduto negibiro kendo gisayo Daudi mondo ochamie gimoro kar odiechiengʼ, to Daudi nosekwongʼore kowacho niya, “Mad Nyasaye ngʼadna bura kata obedo ni en malit manade ka dipo ni abilo chiemo kata chamo chiemo moro amora ka chiengʼ pok opodho.”<verse eid="2SA 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36"/>Ji duto noneno moyie gimor; adieri negimor gi gik moko duto ma ruoth notimo. <verse eid="2SA 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37"/>Omiyo chiengʼno ji duto gi Israel duto nongʼeyo ni ruoth ne ok oriwore e wach nek mar Abner wuod Ner.<verse eid="2SA 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38"/>Eka ruoth nowacho ni joge niya, “Donge ungʼeyo ni jatelo kendo ngʼat maduongʼ osetho e Israel kawuono? <verse eid="2SA 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39"/>Kawuononi, kata bedni an e ngʼat mowir mondo obed ruoth to abwok, yawuot Zeruya-gi otamo wangʼa. Mad Jehova Nyasaye chul kuor ni ngʼama timne rach marom gi timbene maricho!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Oneg Ish-Bosheth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1"/>Kane Ish-Bosheth wuod Saulo owinjo ni Abner nosetho Hebron, chunye noa, kendo Israel duto luoro nomako. <verse eid="2SA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2"/>Koro wuod Saulo ne ni kod ji ariyo mane otelo ni jolweny mane dhi peyo. Achiel kuomgi ne nyinge Baana to machielo ne iluongo ni Rekab; ne gin yawuot Rimon ja-Beeroth, moa dhood Benjamin nikech Beeroth ne ikwano kaka achiel kuom jo-Benjamin, <verse eid="2SA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3"/>nikech jo-Beeroth noringo modhi Gitaim mi gibedo kuno kaka jodak nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="2SA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4"/>Jonathan wuod Saulo ne nigi wuowi mane tiendene ariyo duto ongʼol. Ne en ja-higni abich kane wach Saulo gi Jonathan obiro koa Jezreel. Japite ne okawe mi oringo, kane orikni mondo owuogi nyathi nogore piny mobet rangʼol. Nyinge ne en Mefibosheth.<verse eid="2SA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5"/>Koro Rekab gi Baana, yawuot Rimon ja-Beeroth, ne owuok mondo odhi e od Ish-Boseth, negichopo odiechiengʼ tir sa ma piny liet, noyudo ka oyweyo. <verse eid="2SA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6"/>Negidonjo e ot maiye ka gima gidwaro kawo ngʼatno kendo, negichwowo bund iye. Eka Rekab gi owadgi ma Baana nopusore modhi.<verse eid="2SA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7"/>Negidonjo e ot kane oyudo onindo e kitandane e ode kor nindo. Bangʼ kane gisechwowe ma ginege, negingʼado wiye oko. Negikawo wiye ma gidhigo kendo negiwuotho otieno duto ka giluwo yor Araba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8"/>Negikelo wi Ish-Boseth ni Daudi e piny Hebron mi giwachone ruoth niya, “Ma en wi Ish-Boseth wuod Saulo ma jasiki, mane dwaro negi. Odiechiengni Jehova Nyasaye osechako chulo kuor ni Saulo gi kothe ne ruodha ma en ruoth.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9"/>Daudi nodwoko Rekab gi owadgi ma Baana yawuot Rimon ja-Beeroth niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima, moseresa e masiche duto, <verse eid="2SA 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10"/>kane ngʼato owachona ni, ‘Saulo otho,’ noparo ni okelona wach maber. Ne amake mine onege Ziklag. Mano e mich manamiye kuom kelona wach. <verse eid="2SA 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11"/>To koro nachiw kum malit machalo nadi ka joricho osenego ngʼat maonge ketho e ode owuon kendo e kitandane owuon? Donge owinjore mondo achulni kuor kuom remo ma usechwero, mondo ua e piny!”<verse eid="2SA 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12"/>Omiyo nochiwo chik ni joge, mine ginegogi. Negingʼado lwetgi gi tiendgi mine giliero ringregi e dho yawo man Hebron. Negikawo wi Ish-Boseth ma giyiko e liend Abner e Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 4:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi obedo ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1"/>Dhout Israel duto nobiro Hebron ir Daudi ma giwacho niya, “Wan ringreni kendo wan remo achiel. <verse eid="2SA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2"/>E ndalo mokadho, kane pod Saulo ruodhwa in ema ne itelo ni jo-Israel e lwenjegi. Kendo Jehova Nyasaye nowachoni niya, ‘In ema nibed jakwadh joga Israel, kendo inibed jatendgi.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3"/>Kane jodong Israel duto osebiro Hebron ir Ruoth Daudi notimo kodgi winjruok e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo ne giwiro Daudi mondo obed ruodh Israel.<verse eid="2SA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4"/>Daudi ne ja-higni piero adek kane obedo ruoth, kendo nobedo e loch kuom higni piero angʼwen. <verse eid="2SA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5"/>Ne en e loch kuom higni abiriyo gi dweche auchiel ka en ruodh Juda kodak Hebron kendo ne en ruodh Israel gi Juda kodak Jerusalem kuom higni piero adek gadek.<verse eid="2SA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okawo Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6"/>Ruoth gi joge nodhi Jerusalem momonjo jo-Jebus mane odak kanyo. Jo-Jebus nowacho ni Daudi niya, “Ok inidonj ka; kata mana muofuni gi rangʼonde notami donjo.” Negiparo niya, “Daudi ok nyal donjo kanyo.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7"/>To kata kamano Daudi noloyogi mokawo ohinga mar Sayun, ma en Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8"/>Chiengʼno Daudi nowacho niya, “Ngʼato angʼata madwaro loyo jo-Jebus nyaka kadh e otuchi ma pi kadhogo eka dochop kuom rangʼonde gi muofni, ma gin jowasik Daudi.” Mano ema omiyo nowach ni muofni gi rongʼonde ok nodonj e dala ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9"/>Eka Daudi nodak e dala mochiel gi ohinga moluonge ni Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi. Nogere kolwore gi ohinga motegno gi yo ka iye. <verse eid="2SA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10"/>Kendo nomedo bedo gi teko ahinya, nikech Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ne ni kode.<verse eid="2SA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11"/>Koro Hiram ruodh Turo nooro joote ir Daudi ka gitingʼo sirni mag yiend sida gi jopa bao kod jogedo mag kite, kendo negigero dala ruoth ni Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12"/>Kendo Daudi nongʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye osegure kaka ruodh Israel kendo osetingʼo pinyruodhe malo mana nikech joge Israel.<verse eid="2SA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13"/>Bangʼ kane osedar Hebron, Daudi nokendo monde kaachiel kod mon mamoko Jerusalem kendo nonywolone yawuowi gi nyiri mangʼeny. <verse eid="2SA 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14"/>Magi e nying nyithindo mane onywolo ka en Jerusalem: Shamua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, <verse eid="2SA 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15"/>Ibhar, Elishua, Nefeg, Jafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16"/>Elishama, Eliada kod Elifelet.<verse eid="2SA 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17"/>Kane jo-Filistia owinjo ni Daudi osewir bedo ruodh jo-Israel, negiwuok kar rombgi, mondo gidware, to Daudi nowinjo wachno omiyo nowuok modhi kama ochiel motegno. <verse eid="2SA 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18"/>Koro jo-Filistia nosebiro ma gimonjo holo mar Refaim; <verse eid="2SA 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19"/>omiyo Daudi nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye niya, “bende anyalo dhi mondo amonj jo-Filistia? Bende iniketgi e lweta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke niya, “Dhiyo, nikech abiro chiwo jo-Filistia e lweti.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20"/>Omiyo Daudi nodhi Baal Perazim kendo noloyogi kanyo. Nowacho niya, “Kaka pi muomo, e kaka Jehova Nyasaye osemwomore ni wasika e nyima.” Mano emomiyo kanyo nochak ni Baal-Perizim. <verse eid="2SA 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21"/>Jo-Filistia noweyo nyisechegi kanyo kendo Daudi gi joge notingʼo gi modhigo.<verse eid="2SA 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22"/>Jo-Filistia nochako oyworo ni lweny e holo mar Refaim; <verse eid="2SA 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23"/>omiyo Daudi nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach kendo Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke niya, “Kik ichomgi tir lwor gi yo ka ngʼegi kendo imonjgi kama omanyore gi omburi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24"/>Kiwinjo ka wi omburi yiengni, iwuog mapiyo nikech mano biro nyiso ni Jehova Nyasaye osetelo e nyimi mondo otiek jolweny mag jo-Filistia.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25"/>Omiyo Daudi notimo kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochike, mi nonego jo-Filistia kochakore Gibeon nyaka Gezer.<verse eid="2SA 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Sandug Muma okel Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1"/>Daudi ne ochako okelo jo-Israel kamoro achiel, chwo moyier, maromo alufu piero adek. <verse eid="2SA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2"/>En kod joge duto ne nodhi Baala e piny Juda mondo giom Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye kuno, miluongo gi nying Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, mobet e kind kerubi manie Sandug Muma. <verse eid="2SA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3"/>Negiketo Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye e gari manyien mine gigole e od Abinadab, mane ni ewi got. Uza gi Ahio, ma gin yawuot Abinadab, ema ne chiko gari manyien <verse eid="2SA 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4"/>mane otingʼo Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye, kendo Ahio ne wuotho e nyime. <verse eid="2SA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5"/>Daudi kod dhood Israel duto ne miel gi tekregi duto e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ka giwer gi thumbe gi nyatiti gi orutu gi oyieke gi kayamba gi nyiduonge.<verse eid="2SA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6"/>Kane gichopo kar dino mar Nakon, Uza notero lwete mosiro Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye nimar rwedhi nochwanyore. <verse eid="2SA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7"/>To mirimb Jehova Nyasaye ne ger gi Uza nikech tim mane otimo ma ok ber omiyo Nyasaye nogoye motho but Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye.<verse eid="2SA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8"/>Daudi nokecho nikech mirima mager mar Jehova Nyasaye nomwomore kuom Uza, omiyo nochak kanyo ni Perez Uza, nying ma pod iluongogo kanyo nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="2SA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9"/>Luoro nomako Daudi chiengʼno nikech Jehova Nyasaye, mopenjo niya, “Ere kaka Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye dikel ira?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10"/>Ne ok oyie mondo okaw Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye odhigo e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi. Kar timo mano to nobaro motere e od Obed-Edom ja-Giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11"/>Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ne owe e od Obed-Edom ja-Giti kuom dweche adek, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nogwedhe gi ode duto.<verse eid="2SA 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12"/>Eka nowacho ni Ruoth Daudi niya, “Jehova Nyasaye osegwedho od Obed-Edom gi gige duto nikech Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye.” Omiyo Daudi nolor mwalo kodhi e od Obed-Edom mondo oom Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye, mine okele e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi gi mor. <verse eid="2SA 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13"/>Kane joma otingʼo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye ogoyo ondamo auchiel, notimo misango gi rwath gi nyaroya machwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14"/>Daudi, korwako law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod, nomiel aduwa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye gi tekre duto, <verse eid="2SA 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15"/>e kinde ma en kaachiel gi dhood Israel duto, nokelo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye gi mahu ka igoyo tungʼ.<verse eid="2SA 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16"/>E kinde mane Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye donjo e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi, Mikal nyar Saulo nongʼicho gie dirisa. Kendo kane oneno Ruoth Daudi kachikore kendo miel aduwa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, nochaye gi chunye.<verse eid="2SA 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17"/>Negikelo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye mi gikete kare ei hema mane Daudi osegurone, kendo Daudi notimo misango miwangʼo pep gi misengini mag lalruok michiwo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="2SA 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18"/>Bangʼ kane osetieko timo misango miwangʼo pep gi misengini mag lalruok, nogwedho ji e nying Jehova Nyasaye Maratego. <verse eid="2SA 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19"/>Eka nomiyo oganda Israel duto chwo gi mon, ngʼato ka ngʼato, makati gi olembe mongʼin. Kendo ji duto nodok miechgi.<verse eid="2SA 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20"/>Kane Daudi odok dala mondo ogwedh joode, Mikal nyar Saulo nowuok mondo oromne mowachone niya, “Mano kaka ruodh Israel nomiyore duongʼ kawuono koelore duk e nyim wasumbini ma nyiri mag jotije mana kaka dhano adhana nyalo timo!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21"/>Daudi nowacho ni Mikal niya, “Ne atime e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, mane oyiera kar yiero wuonu kata ngʼato moa e dhoode kane oketa mondo atel ni oganda Jehova Nyasaye ma en Israel, abiro tugo kamiel e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="2SA 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22"/>Abiro medo bedo mofuwo maloyo mae, bende abiro medo dwokora matin e wangʼa awuon. To wasumbini ma nyiri miwachogi, to biro miya duongʼ.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23"/>Kendo Mikal nyar Saulo ne ok onywolo nyithindo nyaka notho.<verse eid="2SA 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Singo mar Nyasaye ni Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1"/>Bangʼe ka ruoth nosedonjo e ode mar ruoth kendo Jehova Nyasaye nosemiye kwe e kinde gi wasike duto mane olwore, <verse eid="2SA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2"/>nowacho ni Nathan janabi niya, “Koro anto adak e od ruoth moger gi yiend sida, to Sandug muma mar Nyasaye to osiko e hema.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3"/>Nathan nodwoko ruoth niya, “Gimoro amora manie pachi, to dhi nyime mondo itim, nikech Jehova Nyasaye ni kodi.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4"/>Otienono wach mar Jehova Nyasaye ne obiro ni Nathan, kawacho niya,<verse eid="2SA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5"/>“Dhiyo mondo inyis jatichna Daudi niya, ‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: In ema digerna ot mondo adagie? <verse eid="2SA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6"/>Pok adak e ot chakre ndalo mane agolo jo-Israel e piny Misri nyaka kawuono. Asebedo kawuotho kuonde miguroe hema mopogore kaka kar dakna. <verse eid="2SA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7"/>Kuonde duto masewuothoe gi jo-Israel duto, bende asewachoe gimoro ni jotendgi mane aketo mondo orit joga Israel niya, “Angʼo momiyo pok ugerona ot mar yiend sida?” ’<verse eid="2SA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8"/>“Omiyo koro wach ni jatichna Daudi niya, ‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho kama: Ne agoli e lek kuma ne ikwayoe rombe mondo ibed jatend joga Israel. <verse eid="2SA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9"/>Asebedo kodi kuonde duto misedhiye, kendo asetieko wasiki duto e nyimi. Koro abiro miyo nyingi bed maduongʼ kaka humb jomadongo manie piny. <verse eid="2SA 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10"/>Kendo abiro chiwo piny ni joga Israel, abiro gurogi mondo gibed gi pinygi giwegi mondo kik chandgi kendo. Jomahundu ok nochak osandgi kendo kaka negitimonegi mokwongo, <verse eid="2SA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11"/>kendo kaka gisetimo nyaka chakre ne ayier jotelo marito joga Israel. Bende abiro miyo ibed gi kwe e kindi gi wasiki duto.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘Jehova Nyasaye owacho ni en Jehova Nyasaye owuon ema obiro geroni ot. <verse eid="2SA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12"/>Ka ndaloni orumo mitho kendo iluwo kwereni to abiro keto kothi moro mondo okaw kari, manobed kothi owuon kendo anagur pinyruodhe. <verse eid="2SA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13"/>En ema noger ot ni nyinga, kendo anagur lochne gi pinyruodhe nyaka chiengʼ. <verse eid="2SA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14"/>Anabed wuon-gi to enobed wuoda. Ka otimo marach, to anakume, ka achwade gi lwet dhano kendo noyud chwat koa kuom ji. <verse eid="2SA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15"/>To herana to ok nogol kuome kaka ne agole kuom Saulo, mane agolo e nyimi. <verse eid="2SA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16"/>Odi gi pinyruodhi nosik nyaka chiengʼ e nyima kendo lochni nogurre nyaka chiengʼ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17"/>Nathan nonyiso Daudi weche duto mane ofwenyne.<verse eid="2SA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lamo mar Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18"/>Eka ruoth Daudi nodonjo e hema mobet piny e nyim Jehova Nyasaye mowacho niya,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“An to an ngʼa? Yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, jooda to gin angʼo, momiyo isetimona gigi duto? <verse eid="2SA 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19"/>To ka gima kamano ok oromo e nyim wangʼi, yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, to isewuoyo kuom gik mabiro timore e od jatichni kinde mabiro. Bende ma e kaka itiyo gi dhano, yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto?<verse eid="2SA 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20"/>“En angʼo ma Daudi dimed wachoni? Nimar ingʼeyo jatichni, yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto. <verse eid="2SA 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21"/>Nikech wach misewacho kendo koluwore gi dwaroni, isetimo tim maduongʼni bende isemiyo ongʼere ni jatichni.<verse eid="2SA 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22"/>“Mano kaka iduongʼ yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto! Onge ngʼama chalo kodi, kendo onge Nyasaye moro makmana in, kaka wasewinjo gi itwa wawegi? <verse eid="2SA 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23"/>Ere oganda machal gi jogi Israel? Bende nitiere oganda moro e piny mane Nyasaye osedhi moreso mondo obed joge owuon kendo mosemiyogo nyinge ongʼere mi otimogo honni madongo kendo malich koriembo ogendini gi nyisechegi ka gia e nyim joge, mane oreso kogolo Misri? <verse eid="2SA 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24"/>Iseguro loch jogi ma jo-Israel kaka jogi iwuon nyaka chiengʼ to in yaye Jehova Nyasaye isebedo Nyasachgi.<verse eid="2SA 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25"/>“To koro Jehova Nyasaye rit singruok misetimo gi jatichni kod ode osik nyaka chiengʼ. Tim mana kaka ne isingori, <verse eid="2SA 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26"/>mondo nyingi obed maduongʼ nyaka chiengʼ. Eka ji biro wacho ni, ‘Jehova Nyasaye Maratego en Nyasach jo-Israel!’ Kendo dhood jatichni Daudi nogurre e nyimi.<verse eid="2SA 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27"/>“Yaye Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, ma Nyasach Israel, isefwenyo ni jatichni wechegi kiwacho ni, ‘Abiro geroni ot.’ Omiyo jatichni osebet gi chir mar lami gi lemoni. <verse eid="2SA 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28"/>Yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, in Nyasaye! Wecheni ogen, kendo isesingo gik mabeyogi ni jatichni. <verse eid="2SA 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29"/>To koro yie mondo igwedh od jatichni, mondo osik e nyimi nyaka chiengʼ; nimar, yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, isewuoyo to gi gwethni, isegwedho dhood jatichni gweth mosiko.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Lwenje ma Daudi oloyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko Daudi noloyo jo-Filistia ma gibedo e bwo lochne, kendo nokawo Metheg Ama mogolo e loch jo-Filistia.<verse eid="2SA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2"/>Daudi noloyo jo-Moab bende. Noketogi ma ginindo piny eka nopimogi gi tol. Kano pimogi diriyo to mago ninego to mane opim mar adek ne iweyo kangima. Omiyo jo-Moab nobedo e bwo loch Daudi kendo negigolone osuru.<verse eid="2SA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3"/>Bende Daudi nokedo gi Hadadezer wuod Rehob, ma ruodh Zoba, eka nodhi mondo ogur lochne e dho Aora Yufrate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4"/>Daudi nomako geche lweny alufu achiel gi joidh farese alufu abiriyo, gi jolweny mawuotho gi tiendgi alufu piero ariyo. Nongʼado odond farese duto.<verse eid="2SA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5"/>Kane jo-Aram moa Damaski obiro konyo Hadadezer ruodh Zoba, Daudi nonego ji alufu piero ariyo gariyo kuomgi. <verse eid="2SA 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6"/>Noketo kambi mag jolwenje e dala maduongʼ mar Damaski e piny jo-Aram kendo jo-Aram nobedo e bwo lochne kendo negikelone osuru. Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo Daudi olocho kamoro amora mane odhiye.<verse eid="2SA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7"/>Daudi nokawo kuodi molos gi dhahabu mane mag jotend lweny mar Hadadezer, mi okelogi Jerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8"/>Ruoth Daudi nokawo mula mogundho chakre Teba nyaka Berothai mane gin miech Hadadezer.<verse eid="2SA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9"/>Kane Tou ruodh Hamath owinjo ni Daudi noloyo jolweny duto mag Hadadezer, <verse eid="2SA 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10"/>nooro wuode miluongo ni Joram ir Ruoth Daudi mondo omose kendo opake kuom loch moloyogo Hadadezer, manosebedo kakedo gi Tou. Joram nokelo gik molos gi fedha, dhahabu to gi mula.<verse eid="2SA 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11"/>Ruoth Daudi nowalo gigi duto momiyo Jehova Nyasaye, mana kaka nosetimo gi fedha gi dhahabu mane oa kuom ogendini mane oloyo kaka: <verse eid="2SA 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12"/>Edom gi Moab gi jo-Amon gi jo-Filistia, gi Amalek. E kaka nowalo bende gik mane oyaki mag Hadadezer wuod Rehob, ma ruodh Zoba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13"/>Kendo Daudi humbe nolandore koa nego jo-Edom alufu apar gaboro e Holo mar Chumbi.<verse eid="2SA 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14"/>Bangʼe noketo kambi askeche e piny Edom duto, mi jo-Edom nobedo e bwo loch Daudi. Kamoro amora ma Daudi nodhiye Jehova Nyasaye nomiye loch.<verse eid="2SA 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jodong Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15"/>Daudi nobedo ruodh jo-Israel duto, kotimo maber kendo makare ni joge duto. <verse eid="2SA 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16"/>Joab wuod Zeruya ne jatend jolweny; Jehoshafat wuod Ahilud ne jachan weche; <verse eid="2SA 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17"/>Zadok wuod Ahitub gi Ahimelek wuod Abiathar ne jodolo; Seraya ne jagoro; <verse eid="2SA 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18"/>Benaya wuod Jehoyada ne jatend jo-Kereth gi jo-Peleth; to yawuot Daudi to ne jangʼad rieko mar joka ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi gi Mefibosheth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1"/>Daudi nopenjo niya, “Bende nitie ngʼato angʼata modongʼ e dhood Saulo manyalo timo ne tim ngʼwono nikech Jonathan?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2"/>Koro ne nitie jatich mane tiyo e od Saulo ma nyinge Ziba. Ne giluonge mondo obi e nyim Daudi mi ruoth nopenje niya, “In e Ziba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Nodwoko niya, “Ee, en an jatichni.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3"/>Eka ruoth nopenje niya, “Onge ngʼat ma dipo kodongʼ e dhood Saulo ma anyalo timo ne tim ngʼwono mar Nyasaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ziba nodwoko ruoth kowacho niya, “Nitie wuod Jonathan; to tiendene duto ongʼol.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4"/>Ruoth nopenjo niya, “En kanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ziba nodwoke niya, “En e od Makir wuod Amiel modak Lo Debar.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5"/>Omiyo ruoth nochiko mondo okele kigole Lo Debar e od Makir wuod Amiel.<verse eid="2SA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6"/>Kane Mefibosheth wuod Jonathan, ma wuod Saulo, obiro ir Daudi, nokulore piny komiye duongʼ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Daudi noluonge niya, “Mefibosheth!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Nodwoke niya, Ee, en an jatichni.<verse eid="2SA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7"/>Daudi nowachone niya, “Kik iluor, nimar gadiera abiro timoni tim ngʼwono nikech wuonu Jonathan. Abiro dwokoni puothe duto mane mag kwaru Saulo, kendo inichiem e mesana kinde duto.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8"/>Mefibosheth nokulore piny mowacho niya, “An mana misumbani, ngʼat machalo gi guok motho, to angʼo momiyo itimona maber kama?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9"/>Eka ruoth noluongo Ziba, ma jatich Saulo mowachone niya, “Amiyo nyakwar ruodhi gik moko duto mane mag Saulo gi joode. <verse eid="2SA 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10"/>In gi yawuoti kod jotiji ubiro purone kendo ukel cham mondo nyakwar ruodhi obed gi chiemo to Mefibosheth, nyakwar ruodhi, to biro chiemo e mesana pile.” Ziba ne nigi yawuowi apar gabich gi jotich piero ariyo.<verse eid="2SA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11"/>Eka Ziba nowachone ruoth niya, “Jatiji biro timo gimoro amora ma ruodha ma ruoth ochiko jatichne mondo otim.” Omiyo Mefibosheth nochiemo e mesa Daudi mana kaka achiel kuom yawuot ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12"/>Mefibosheth ne nigi wuode matin miluongo ni Mika, to jood Ziba duto ne gin jotij Mefibosheth. <verse eid="2SA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13"/>Kendo Mefibosheth nodak Jerusalem nikech ne ochiemo pile e mesa ruoth, to tiendene ariyo ne ongʼol.<verse eid="2SA 9:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo-Amon e lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko ruodh jo-Amon notho, mi Hanun wuode nobedo ruoth kare. <verse eid="2SA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2"/>Daudi noparo niya, “Abiro timo maber ni Hanun wuod Nahash, mana kaka wuon-gi bende notimona tim ngʼwono.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Omiyo Daudi nooro joote mondo odhi ogone mos makende kuom tho mar wuon-gi. Kane joote Daudi ochopo e piny jo-Amon, <verse eid="2SA 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3"/>jotelo mag jo-Amon nowachone Hanun ma ruodhgi niya, “Iparo ni Daudi miyo wuonu duongʼ ka ooro ji iri mondo ogoni mos? Donge Daudi oorogi mana mondo gibi ginon dala maduongʼ mondo oyud kaka dokawe?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4"/>Omiyo Hanun nomako joote Daudi molielo bath yie tik moro ka moro nyakonchiel; nongʼado lepgi e diere tir chakre e nungogi nyaka piny, moriembogi gidhi.<verse eid="2SA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5"/>Kane onyis Daudi wachni, nooro joote mondo odhi orom ni jogo, nikech nokuod wigi marach. Ruoth nowachonegi niya, “Beduru Jeriko nyaka yie tiku ti, eka uduogi.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6"/>Kane jo-Amon oneno ka gisechido chuny Daudi, negichulo jo-Aram mondo omigi jolweny mawuotho gi tiendgi ji alufu piero ariyo moa Beth Rehob gi Zoba, to gi ruodh Maaka bende nomiyogi jolweny alufu achiel to gi jolweny alufu apar gariyo moa Tob.<verse eid="2SA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7"/>Ka Daudi nowinjo mano nooro Joab gi jolweny duto ma jokedo. <verse eid="2SA 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8"/>Jo-Amon nobiro mi giriedo ne lweny e dhoranga dalagi maduongʼ, ka jo-Aram moa Zoba gi Rehob gi jo-Tob gi Maaka ne nikendgi e pap oko.<verse eid="2SA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9"/>Joab noneno ni wasigu ni yo ka nyime gi yo katoke; omiyo noyiero jolweny mabeyo moloyo ei Israel, moketogi mondo giked gi jo-Aram. <verse eid="2SA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10"/>To joma odongʼ duto noketo e bwo Abishai mowadgi mondo oked gi jo-Amon. <verse eid="2SA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11"/>Joab nowacho niya, “Ka jo-Aram tek moloya, to ubi ukonya, to ka jo-Amon tek moloyou, to anabi mondo akonyi. <verse eid="2SA 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12"/>Beduru motegno mondo waked gi chir ni jowa kendo ni mier madongo mag Nyasachwa. Jehova Nyasaye biro timo gima oneno ni ber e nyim wangʼe.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13"/>Eka Joab gi jolweny mane ni kode nodhi mondo oked gi jo-Aram, kendo negiringo e nyimgi. <verse eid="2SA 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14"/>Kane jo-Amon oneno ka jo-Aram ringo tony, gin bende negiringo ka gitony e nyim Abishai mi gidonjo e dala maduongʼ. Omiyo Joab noweyo kedo gi jo-Amon modok Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15"/>Bangʼ kane jo-Aram oneno ni jo-Israel oseloyogi, negichokore kendo. <verse eid="2SA 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16"/>Hadadezer nooro wach mondo okel jo-Aram man loka Aora Yufrate kendo gidhi Helam ka Shobak ma en jatend jolweny mag Hadadezer, otelonegi.<verse eid="2SA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17"/>Kane owach ni Daudi wachno, nochoko jo-Israel duto, mongʼado aora Jordan modhi Helam. Jo-Aram nochanore ni lweny mondo girad gi Daudi kendo negikedo kode. <verse eid="2SA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18"/>To jo-Israel noloyogi mi giringo, kendo Daudi nonego joidh gechegi mag farese mia abiriyo kod jolweny mag-gi mawuotho gi tielo alufu piero angʼwen. Nochwowo Shobak jatend jolweny, motho kanyo. <verse eid="2SA 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19"/>Kane ruodhi duto mane ni e bwo loch Hadadezer oneno ni jo-Israel oseloyogi, negiloso kwe e kindgi gi jo-Israel mi gibedo e bwo lochgi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Omiyo jo-Aram nobedo maluor mar konyo jo-Amon kendo.<verse eid="2SA 10:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi gi Bathsheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1"/>E ndalo mar chwiri, e kinde ma ruodhi dhi e lweny, Daudi nooro Joab gi joka ruoth to gi jolweny mag Israel duto. Negigoyo jo-Amon mi gitiekogi kendo negimako dala mar Raba. To Daudi nodongʼ e Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2"/>Odhiambo moro Daudi noa malo e kitandane mowuotho alwora mar wi tado mar ode ka en ewi tado noneno dhako moro kaluokore. To dhakono ne jaber ahinya, <verse eid="2SA 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3"/>omiyo Daudi nooro ngʼato mondo odhi onon ni en dhako mane. Ngʼatno nowacho, “Donge mano en Bathsheba, ma nyar Eliam ma chi Uria ja-Hiti?” <verse eid="2SA 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4"/>Eka Daudi nooro jaote mondo odhi okele, mi dhakono nobiro ire kendo noterore kode. Ma noyudo ka koro eka otieko kindene mar neno malo kendo nosepwodhore. Bangʼ mano Bathsheba nodok dala. <verse eid="2SA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5"/>Dhakono nomako ich mi nooro ni Daudi wach kowacho niya, “Ayach.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6"/>Omiyo Daudi nooro wach ni Joab niya, “Orna Uria ja-Hiti.” Eka Joab noore ir Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7"/>Kane Uria obiro ire, Daudi nopenje ngima Joab gi mar jolweny to gi kaka lweny bende dhi. <verse eid="2SA 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8"/>Eka Daudi nowachone ni Uria niya, “Dhi mwalo e odi mondo ilwok tiendi.” Omiyo Uria nowuok oa e dala ruoth, eka bangʼe ruoth noorone mich. <verse eid="2SA 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9"/>To Uria nonindo e dhorangach mar dala gi jotich mamoko mag ruoth to ne ok olor odhi e ode.<verse eid="2SA 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10"/>Kane owach ne Daudi ni Uria ne ok odhi ode, nopenje niya, “Donge isebudho oko, angʼo momoni dhi odi?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11"/>Uria nowachone Daudi niya, “Sandug Muma gi Israel gi Juda dak e hembe, to jatenda ma Joab gi jo-ruodha obuoro oko e pap. Ere kaka anyalo dhi e oda mondo achiem, kendo amethi, mi ariwra e achiel gi chiega? Akwongʼora e nyimi ni ok datim gima kamano.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12"/>Eka Daudi nowachone niya, “Bed ka kawuono kiny naweyi idog.” Omiyo Uria noriyo Jerusalem chiengʼno gi kinyne. <verse eid="2SA 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13"/>Daudi noluonge mochiemo mi ometho kode kendo Daudi nomiye math momer. To kotieno nochopo Uria nowuok modhi onindo e pare kaachiel gi jotij ruodhe; to ne ok odhi ode.<verse eid="2SA 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14"/>To gokinyi Daudi nondiko ne Joab baruwa moorogo Uria mondo oter. <verse eid="2SA 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15"/>Ei baruwano nondikoe niya, “Ket Uria e laini manyime kama lweny gerie ahinya. Eka weyeuru kende mondo ogoye manege.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16"/>Omiyo kane Joab olworo dala maduongʼno mondo gimaki, noketo Uria kama ongʼeyo ni wasigu mager kendo tek nitie. <verse eid="2SA 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17"/>Kane jo-dala maduongʼno owuok mondo oked gi Joab, jolwenj Daudi moko nonegi; to Uria ja-Hiti bende nonegi.<verse eid="2SA 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18"/>Joab nooro wach ne Daudi konyise gik moko duto mosetimore e lweny. <verse eid="2SA 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19"/>Nochiko jaote niya, “Ka isetieko nyiso ruoth wechegi duto matimore e lweny, <verse eid="2SA 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20"/>kamoro mirima nyalo mako ruoth, mi openji ni, ‘Angʼo momiyo ne usudo machiegni ahinya gi dala maduongʼ mondo ukedi? Donge ne ungʼeyo niginyalo chielou gi aserenigi ewi ohinga? <verse eid="2SA 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21"/>En ngʼa ma nonego Abimelek wuod Jerub-Besheth? Dhako donge ema nodiro pongʼ rego gi ewi ohinga, mine otho Thebez? Angʼo momiyo ne udhi machiegni ahinya gi ohinga?’ Kopenji penjoni, to wachne ni, ‘Jatichni Uria ja-Hiti bende otho.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22"/>Jaote nowuok modhi, kane ochopo nonyiso Daudi weche duto mane Joab oore mondo owachi. <verse eid="2SA 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23"/>Jaoteno nowachone Daudi niya, “Jogo nochako loyowa mi giwuok e pap mondo giked kodwa to ne wariembogi ma wadwokogi chien nyaka e dhoranga dala maduongʼ. <verse eid="2SA 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24"/>Eka jodir aserni nobayo jotichni gi ewi ohinga, kendo jotich ruoth moko nonegi. Uria ja-Hiti ma jatichni bende ginego.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25"/>Daudi nowachone jaote niya, “Wachne Joab kama: Kik wachno chandi; ligangla nego jakoni gi jakocha. Med kedo matek gi dala maduongʼno mi ikethe chuth. Wachne wechegi mondo ijiwego.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26"/>Kane chi Uria owinjo ni chwore otho, noywage. <verse eid="2SA 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27"/>Bangʼ ka ndalo ywak norumo, Daudi nowacho mondo okele e ode, mane obedo chiege monywolone nyathi ma wuowi. To gima Daudi notimo ne ok omoro Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="2SA 11:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nathan okwero Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1"/>Jehova Nyasaye nooro Nathan ir Daudi. Kane ochopo ire nowachone niya, “Ne nitie ji ariyo moko e dala moro; achiel ne jamoko to machielo nodhier. <verse eid="2SA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2"/>Jamoko ne nigi rombe mangʼeny gi dhok, <verse eid="2SA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3"/>to ngʼat modhier to ne onge gimoro makmana nyarombo ma sibini achiel mane osengʼiewo. Norite maber mana kaka norito nyithinde owuon. Nyarombono nopogone chiembe mochamo, ne omodho e okombene kendo nonindo e bade. Ne ochalne mana ka nyathine ma nyako.<verse eid="2SA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4"/>“Koro jawuoth moro nobiro ir jamoko-cha, to jamokono ne ok okawo achiel kuom rombe kata dhoge mondo oyangʼ ni jawuodhno mane obiro ireno. Kata kamano, nyarombo ma sibini mar jadhierno ema noyangʼone wendo mane obiro ire.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5"/>Mirima malich ne omako Daudi gi ngʼatno mowachone Nathan niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni ngʼat mane otimo kama owinjore otho! <verse eid="2SA 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6"/>Nyaka ochul kar rombono moloyo nyadingʼwen, nikech ne otimo gima chalo kama, ka chunye onge gi kech.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7"/>Eka Nathan nodimbo wach ne Daudi niya, “In e ngʼatno! Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel wacho: ‘Ne awiri mondo ibed ruoth Israel, ne agoli e lwet Saulo. <verse eid="2SA 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8"/>Ne amiyi od ruodhi mondo obed mari, kendo naketo monde ruodhi e lweti. Ne amiyi dhout Israel gi dhood Juda. To ka magi ne ok oromi to pod ne anyalo miyi moko. <verse eid="2SA 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9"/>Angʼo momiyo isechayo wach Jehova Nyasaye ka itimo gima rach machal kama e wangʼe? Ne inego Uria ja-Hiti gi ligangla mi ikawo chiege mondo obed mari iwuon. Ne inege gi ligangla jo-Amon. <verse eid="2SA 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10"/>Kuom mano, negruok gi ligangla ok norum e odi, nikech ne ichaya mi ikawo chi Uria ja-Hiti mobedo mari iwuon.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11"/>“Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: ‘Anakelni masira kowuok e odi iwuon. Mana kineno kama gi wangʼi iwuon abiro kawo mondi kendo miyogi achiel kuom joma chiegni kodi, kendo obiro terore kod mondegi odiechiengʼ alanga. <verse eid="2SA 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12"/>Nitimo gino apanda, to an abiro timo ma odiechiengʼ alanga e nyim jo-Israel.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13"/>Eka Daudi nowachone Nathan niya, “Asekethone Jehova Nyasaye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Nathan nodwoko niya, “Jehova Nyasaye oseweyoni richoni. Ok ibi tho. <verse eid="2SA 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14"/>To nikech gima isetimo, isemiyo jowasigu ojaro Jehova Nyasaye, omiyo wuodi monywolno biro tho.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15"/>Bangʼ kane Nathan osedhi dala, Jehova Nyasaye nogoyo nyathi ma chi Uria nosenywolo ni Daudi gi tuo. <verse eid="2SA 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16"/>Daudi nolamo Nyasaye mondo kik nyathi tho. Notweyo chiemo kendo nodhi e ode mi onindo piny e lowo otieno ka otieno. <verse eid="2SA 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17"/>Jodongo mag ode nochungʼ bathe mondo gichunge owe nindo piny e lowo, to notamore, kendo ne ok onyal chamo chiemo moro amora.<verse eid="2SA 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18"/>To chiengʼ mar abiriyo nyathi notho, jotij Daudi ne luor nyise ni nyathi osetho, nikech negiparo niya, “Kane nyathi pod ngima, ne wawuoyo gi Daudi to ne ok owinjowa. Koro to wadhi wacho ne nangʼo ka nyathi osetho? Onyalo timo gimoro marach.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19"/>Daudi noneno ka jotije kuodho wach kendgi mine ongʼeyo ni nyathi osetho. Nopenjo niya, “Nyathi osetho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Negidwoke niya, “Ee, osetho.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20"/>Daudi noa malo e lowo. Kane oseluokore, nowirore gi mo moloko lewni mane orwako, nodhi e od Jehova Nyasaye mi olemo. Bangʼe nodhi e ode owuon, mine okwayo chiemo momiye mochamo.<verse eid="2SA 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21"/>Jotije nopenje niya, “Itimori kama nangʼo? Kane nyathi pod ngima, ne itweyo chiemo kendo ne iywak. To ka nyathi koro osetho, to ichungʼ kendo ichiemo!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22"/>Nodwokogi niya, “Kane nyathi pod ngima ne atweyo chiemo kendo aywak. Nikech ne aparo ni, ‘Ngʼama dingʼe? Dipo ka Jehova Nyasaye nyalo timona ngʼwono miwe nyathi obed mangima.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23"/>To nikech koro osetho, angʼo dimi atwe chiemo? Bende daduoge obed mangima? An ema abiro dhi ire to en ok onyal duogo ira.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24"/>Daudi nohoyo Bathsheba chiege, nodhi ire mobedo kode e achiel. Nonywolo wuowi kendo negichake ni Solomon. Jehova Nyasaye ne ohere; <verse eid="2SA 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25"/>kendo nikech Jehova Nyasaye nohere, nomiyo Nathan janabi wach ni mondo ochake ni Jedidia.<verse eid="2SA 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26"/>Kata kamano Joab nodhi nyime kedo gi Raba e piny jo-Amon kendo nomako kar ruoth mochiel motegno. <verse eid="2SA 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27"/>Joab nooro joote ir Daudi, kowacho niya, “Asekedo gi Raba ma amako kargi mar pi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28"/>Koro bi gi jolweny duto mondo ilwor dala maduongʼ kendo ikawe. Ka ok kamano to abiro kawo dala maduongʼno kendo ibiro luonge gi nyinga.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29"/>Omiyo Daudi nochoko jolweny duto modhigo Raba mi omonje kendo okawe. <verse eid="2SA 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30"/>Nogolo osimbo mar duongʼ ewi ruodhgi, ma pek dhahabu mane olosego ne romo kilo piero adek gangʼwen kendo noduse gi kite ma nengogi tek mi osidhne Daudi. Noyako gik mangʼeny e dala maduongʼno <verse eid="2SA 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31"/>kendo nokawo ji duto mane ni e dalano, moketogi e tij ngʼeto gi musimeno kod tiyo gi chumbe gi ledhi; bende ne oketogi jolos matafare. Notimo ma ni mier duto mag jo-Amon. Eka Daudi gi jolwenje duto nodok Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Amnon gi Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko, Amnon wuod Daudi nochako gombo Tamar, nyako ma jaber mane nyamin Abisalom wuod Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2"/>Chuny Amnon ne chandore mobedo matuo nikech wach nyamin-gi Tamar, nimar ne en nyako ngili, kuom mano ne tek mondo otim kode gimoro.<verse eid="2SA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3"/>Koro Amnon ne nigi osiepne miluongo ni Jonadab wuod Shimea, ma owadgi Daudi. Jonadab ne en ngʼat ma riekone richo. <verse eid="2SA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4"/>Nopenjo Amnon niya, “Yaye wuod ruoth, angʼo momiyo inenori mokuyo pile ka pile? Ok diwachna gima timi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnon nodwoke niya, “Ahero Tamar ma nyamin owadwa Abisalom.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5"/>Jonadab nowachone niya, “Dhiyo inind e kitanda ka iwuondri ni ituo. Ka wuonu obiro neni, to wachne ni, ‘Daher mondo nyamera ma Tamar obi omiya gimoro acham. Yie mondo obi otedna chiemo kaneno mondo mi anene kaka otedo; kendo acham chiemo kotingʼo e lwete.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6"/>Omiyo Amnon nonindo kowuondore ni otuo. Kane ruoth obiro nene, Amnon nowachone niya, “Daher mondo nyamera ma Tamar obi olosna makati moro mopogore gi mapile kaneno, mondo mi achame kotingʼe e lwete.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7"/>Daudi nooro wach ne Tamar e dala ruoth kama: “Dhi e od owadu Amnon mondo itedne chiemo.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8"/>Omiyo Tamar nodhi e od owadgi ma Amnon mane oyudo nindo. Nokawo mogo modwalo mi otedo makati koneno. <verse eid="2SA 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9"/>Eka nokawo gima notedoe mi omiye makati, to notamore chamo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amnon nowachone niya, “Riemb jogi duto oko.” Omiyo ji duto nowuok oko oweye. <verse eid="2SA 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10"/>Eka Amnon nowachone Tamar niya, “Kel chiemo kor nindona koni mondo mi achiem kitingʼona chiemo e lweti.” Kendo Tamar nokawo makati mano tedo motero ni Amnon owadgi kor nindone. <verse eid="2SA 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11"/>Kane oterone chiemo mondo ocham nomake githuon koywaye mowachone niya, “Nyamera, bi wanind e kitandana ka.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12"/>En to nodwoke niya, “Kik itim gima kama, owadwa. Kik ichuna. Gima kama ok onego timre e Israel! Kik itim tim marachni. <verse eid="2SA 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13"/>An to dabed nade? Wichkuot machal kama dater kanye? To in to? Dibed machal kaka achiel kuom joricho mofuwo e Israel. Kiyie to wuo gi ruoth; ok obi tamore mondo kik ikenda.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14"/>To notamore winje, to kaka notek moloye, noterore kode githuon.<verse eid="2SA 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15"/>Eka Amnon nosin mojok kode ahinya. Chutho, nosin mojok kode moloyo kaka ne ohere. Amnon nowachone niya, “Chungi kendo wuog idhi!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16"/>Nodwoke niya, “Ooyo. Riemba kama biro bedo marach moloyo kata mana rach misetimona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">To nodagi winje. <verse eid="2SA 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17"/>Noluongo jatije mowachone ni, Gol dhakoni oko ka kendo ilor dhoot matek bangʼe. <verse eid="2SA 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18"/>Omiyo jatije nogole oko moloro dhoot matek bangʼe. Noyudo nyakono orwako law molos maber manyilni mane itwangʼo ni nyiri ngili ma nyi joka ruoth. <verse eid="2SA 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19"/>Tamar noolo buru e wiye mi noyiecho lawe manyilni mane otwangʼ maber mane oyudo orwako. Nomako wiye gi lwete kendo nodhi koywak matek.<verse eid="2SA 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20"/>Owadgi ma Abisalom nopenjo niya, “Dibedni owadu ma Amnon osebedo kodi e achiel? Koro sani lingʼ mos nyamera; en owadu. Kik wachni chand chunyi.” Kendo Tamar nodak gi Abisalom e ode, ka en dhako mokuyo.<verse eid="2SA 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21"/>Ruoth Daudi iye nowangʼ ahinya kane owinjo wechegi duto. <verse eid="2SA 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22"/>Abisalom ne ok owacho gimoro maber kata marach ni Amnon; to nosin kod Amnon nikech ne osekuodo wi Tamar nyamin-gi.<verse eid="2SA 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisalom onego Amnon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23"/>Bangʼ higni ariyo, kane jongʼad yie romb Abisalom ni Baal Hazor machiegni gi tongʼ Efraim, noluongo yawuot ruoth duto mondo obi kanyo. <verse eid="2SA 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24"/>Abisalom nodhi ir ruoth mowachone niya, “Jatichni osechoko joge mangʼado yie rombe. Bende ruoth kod jodonge diyie bi?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25"/>Ruoth nodwoke niya, “Ooyo wuoda.” Waduto ok onego wabi, wabiro miyi tingʼ mapek. Kata obedo ni Abisalom nomedo hombe, to pod nodagi dhi, makmana ne oyiene ni odhi nyime gi nyasino.<verse eid="2SA 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26"/>Eka Abisalom nowacho niya, “Kare ka kamano to we owadwa Amnon odhi kodwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">To ruoth nopenje niya, “Angʼo momiyo dodhi kodu?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27"/>To Abisalom nohombe, omiyo noyiene mi gidhi gi Amnon to gi yawuot ruoth mamoko.<verse eid="2SA 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28"/>Abisalom nosechiko jotijene niya, “Winjuru! Ka Amnon osemetho momer, to anawachnu ni, Goyeuru ma unege. Kik ubed maluor. Donge an ema asechikou? Beduru motegno kendo ma jochir.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29"/>Omiyo jotije Abisalom notimo ni Amnon kaka nosechikgi. Eka yawuot ruoth duto nochungʼ moidho kanjegi moringo.<verse eid="2SA 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30"/>Kane pod gin e yo, wach nochopo ne Daudi niya, “Abisalom osenego yawuot ruoth duto; maonge kata achiel kuomgi modongʼ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31"/>Ruoth nochungʼ malo, noyiecho lepe mi onindo piny kendo jotijene duto nochungʼ bute ka lepgi oyiech.<verse eid="2SA 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32"/>To Jonadab wuod Shimea ma owadgi Daudi, nowachone niya, “Ruodha kik par ni gisenego yawuot ruoth duto. En mana Amnon kende ema otho. Abisalom osebedo gi paroni e chunye chakre chiengʼ mane Amnon oterore gi nyamin-gi Tamar githuon. <verse eid="2SA 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33"/>Ruodha ma en ruoth ok onego kaw wach mar tho yawuot ruoth ka gimoro. En mana Amnon kende ema otho.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34"/>Noyudo ka Abisalom oseringo modhi opondo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Koro ngʼat mane rito notingʼo wangʼe moneno ji mangʼeny moa yo podho chiengʼ ka gilor e bath got. Jaritno nodhi ir ruoth monyise ni, Aneno ji kalor e bath got, yo Horonaim.<verse eid="2SA 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35"/>Jonadab nowachone ruoth niya, “Ne yawuot ruoth osechopo ka; otimore mana kaka jatichni nowacho.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36"/>Kane otieko wuoyo, yawuot ruoth nochopo ka gigoyo nduru matek. Ruoth bende gi jotichne duto noywak malit ahinya.<verse eid="2SA 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37"/>Abisalom noringo modhi ir Talmai wuod Amihud ruodh Geshur. To Ruoth Daudi noywago wuode pile pile.<verse eid="2SA 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38"/>Bangʼ ka Abisalom oseringo modhi Geshur, nobet kuno kuom higni adek. <verse eid="2SA 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39"/>Eka chuny ruoth nogombo neno Abisalom, nimar chunye nosea e wach tho mar Amnon.<verse eid="2SA 13:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Abisalom odwogo Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1"/>Joab wuod Zeruya nongʼeyo ni chuny ruoth gombo Abisalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2"/>Omiyo Joab nooro ngʼat moro Tekoa mi okelne dhako moro mariek koa kuno. Nowachone niya, “Wuondri ni ikuyo. Rwak lep ywak kendo kik iwirri gi mo del. Chal ka dhako mosebet ka ywago ngʼate motho kuom ndalo mangʼeny. <verse eid="2SA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3"/>Bangʼe idhi ir ruoth kendo iwachne wechegi.” Joab nomiye weche monego owach.<verse eid="2SA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4"/>Kane dhako moa Tekoa odhi ir ruoth, nokulore nyaka e lowo auma mar miye luor, eka nowachone niya, “Konya, yaye ruoth!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5"/>Ruoth nopenje niya, “Angʼo machandi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Nowacho niya, “Chutho, an dhako ma chwore otho; chwora nosetho. <verse eid="2SA 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6"/>An jatichni, ne an gi yawuowi ariyo. Negigore ka gin oko e pap, ne onge ngʼato machiegni mane nyalo thegogi. Achiel nogoyo machielo mi onege. <verse eid="2SA 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7"/>Koro anywola duto orido ni jatichni matek; kagiwacho ni, Gol ngʼat mane onego owadgi, mondo wanege, kaka ne onego owadgi; eka wanatieki nyaka jarit girkeni bende. Koro gidwaro nego mirni maliel madongʼ-go, ka giweyo chwora dongʼ maonge nying kata kothe modongʼ e wangʼ piny.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8"/>Ruoth nowacho ni dhakoni niya, “Dhi dala, kendo abiro golo chik e wachnino.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9"/>To dhako moa Tekoa nowachone niya, “Ruodha ma en ruoth, we mondo ketho odongʼ e wiya kendo ewi dhood wuora, to mondo ruoth gi kom ruodhe obed maonge ketho.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10"/>Ruoth nodwoke niya, “Ka ngʼato owachoni gimoro, to mondo ikele ira, ma ok nochak ochandi kendo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11"/>Nowacho niya, “Kara koro ruoth osingre gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ni odhi tamo jachul kuor mondo kik omed ketho kendo mondo wuoda kik negi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Nowacho niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni onge yie wi wuodi kata achiel manolwar piny.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12"/>Eka dhakono nowachone niya, “Yie iwe jatichni owach wach moro ni ruodhe ma en ruoth.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Nodwoke niya, “Wachi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13"/>Kendo dhakono nowacho niya, “Kara en angʼo momiyo isengʼado wach marach kama kuom jo-Nyasaye? Ka ruoth wacho kama, donge ongʼado bura ne en owuon, nikech ruoth pok odwogo wuode mane oriembi. <verse eid="2SA 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14"/>Kaka pi mopukore piny ma ok nyal tuom kendo, omiyo nyaka watho. To Nyasaye ok neg ngʼato; kar timo kamano, to oloso yore mondo ngʼat mane oriembi kik osiki ka en jasike.<verse eid="2SA 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15"/>“To koro sani asebiro mondo awach ma ni ruodha ma en ruoth nikech ji osemiya luoro. Jatichni noparo ni, ‘Abiro wuoyo gi ruoth; kamoro dipo kotimo gima jatichne okwaye. <verse eid="2SA 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16"/>Kamoro dipo ruoth biro yie mondo okony jatichne e lwet ngʼat madwaro tieka an kaachiel gi wuoda e girkeni mane Nyasaye omiyowa.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17"/>“To koro sani jatichni wacho ni, ‘Mad wach ruodha kelna kwe, nimar ruodha ma en ruoth chal gi malaika mar Nyasaye manono ber gi rach. Mad Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi bed kodi.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18"/>Eka ruoth nowacho ni dhakono niya, “Kik ipandna dwoko e gima adwaro penji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Dhakono nowacho niya, “Ruodha ma en ruoth owuo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19"/>Ruoth nopenje niya, “Donge Joab ni kodi e wechegi duto?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Dhakono nodwoke niya, “Akwongʼora e nyimi ni in ruodha ma en ruoth kendo ni gima iwachono en adier. Ee, ne en jatichni Joab mane onyisa mondo atim ma kendo en bende ema noketo wechegi e dho jatichni. <verse eid="2SA 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20"/>Jatichni Joab notimo ma mondo okel lokruok kuom gik matimore sanigi. Ruodha nigi rieko ka mar malaika mar Nyasaye kendo ongʼeyo gik moko duto matimore e pinywa ka.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21"/>Ruoth nowacho ni Joab niya, “Mano kare, abiro timo kamano. Dhiyo mondo iom wuowi ma Abisalom oduogi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22"/>Joab nopodho piny auma e nyime mondo omiye duongʼ, kendo nogwedho ruoth. Joab nowacho niya, “Kawuononi jatichni ongʼeyo ni ogene gi ruodha ma en ruoth, nikech ruoth oseyie timo gima jatichne okwaye.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23"/>Eka Joab nodhi Geshur mi okelo Abisalom Jerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24"/>To ruoth nowachone niya, “Nyaka odhi e ode owuon; kendo kik obi buta.” Omiyo Abisalom nodhi e ode owuon kendo ne ok osudo machiegni gi ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25"/>Ei Israel duto ne onge ngʼama ipako ni jaber ka Abisalom. Koa e wiye nyaka e pat tiende ne oonge gi mbala moro amora kuome. <verse eid="2SA 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26"/>E kinde duto mane olielo yie wiye, nimar nojaliel wiye kinde ka kinde nikech yie wiye ne dongo piyo kendo bedone mapek, kane opime to ne oloyo kilo ariyo kopim gi rapim mar joka ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27"/>Abisalom nonywolo yawuowi adek gi nyako achiel. Nyare ne iluongo ni Tamar, kendo nodongo nyako ma jaber.<verse eid="2SA 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28"/>Abisalom nodak Jerusalem kuom higni ariyo kapok osudo machiegni but ruoth. <verse eid="2SA 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29"/>Eka Abisalom noluongo Joab mondo oore ir ruoth, to Joab nodagi dhi ire. Omiyo nochako ooro wach mar ariyo to nochako odagi. <verse eid="2SA 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30"/>Eka nowachone jotije niya, “Neuru puoth Joab omakore gi mara, kendo cham mar shairi ni e iye. Dhiuru umokie mach.” Omiyo jotij Abisalom nodhi momoko mach e puodhono.<verse eid="2SA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31"/>Eka Joab nodhi ir Abisalom e ode mowachone niya, “Angʼo momiyo jotiji owangʼo puotha?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32"/>Abisalom nowacho ni Joab niya, “Ne, naoroni wach kawacho ni, ‘Bi mondo aori ir ruoth mondo ipenje kama: “Angʼo momiyo nabiro kawuok Geshur? Dine ber kane pod an kuno!” ’ Sani koro adwaro dhi neno ruoth, to ka an gi ketho moro, to mondo onega.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33"/>Omiyo Joab nodhi ir ruoth mowachone wechegi. Eka ruoth noluongo Abisalom, mi nodonjo kendo nokulore auma piny e nyim ruoth. Ruoth nonyodho Abisalom.<verse eid="2SA 14:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Abisalom ochano loko loch</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko, Abisalom nongʼiewo gari gi farese kendo ne en gi ji piero abich mane ringo e nyime. <verse eid="2SA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2"/>Ne ochiewo gokinyi kendo nochungʼ e bath yo mochiko dhoranga dala maduongʼ. E kinde duto mane ngʼato angʼata obiro man-gi wach modwaro mondo ruoth ongʼadnee rieko, Abisalom ne luonge kapenje niya, “Ia e dala mane?” To nodwoke niya, “Jatichni oa e achiel kuom dhout Israel.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3"/>Eka Abisalom ne odwoke niya, “Aneno ni wecheni beyo kendo gin adier; to makmana ni onge ngʼat ma ruoth oseketo mondo owinjne weche makamagi.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4"/>Kendo Abisalom nomedo wacho niya, “Ka dine yiera mondo abed jangʼad bura e piny, to ngʼato angʼata man-gi ywak kata wach moro, nyalo biro ira kendo anyalo neno ni ongʼadne bura mowinjore.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5"/>Bende e kinde ma ngʼato angʼata nobiro ire mondo okulre e nyime, Abisalom ne mako lwet ngʼatno kendo nyodhe. <verse eid="2SA 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6"/>Abisalom notimo kama ni jo-Israel duto mane biro ir ruoth mondo ongʼadnigi bura, kendo noywayogo chuny jo-Israel.<verse eid="2SA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7"/>Bangʼ ka higni angʼwen noserumo, Abisalom nowachone ruoth niya, “Yiena mondo adhi Hebron kendo achop singruok moro mane atimo gi Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="2SA 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8"/>Kane jatichni odak Geshur e piny Aram, ne asingora kama: ‘Ka Jehova Nyasaye noduoga Jerusalem, to anadhi alam Jehova Nyasaye Hebron.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9"/>Ruoth nowachone niya, “Dhi gi kwe.” Omiyo nodhi Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10"/>Eka Abisalom nooro joote lingʼ-lingʼ e dhout Israel duto kowacho niya, “E sa moro amora ma unuwinj ka turumbete oywak, to wachuru ni, ‘Ruodh Hebron, en Abisalom.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11"/>Ji mia ariyo moa Jerusalem nobiro kod Abisalom. Ne oluong-gi kaka welo mi gidhi gichuny maler ka ok gingʼeyo gimoro amora madhi nyime. <verse eid="2SA 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12"/>Kane Abisalom timo misengini, nooro joote mondo oom Ahithofel ma ja-Gilon, jangʼad rieko ni Daudi mondo obi koa Gilo, ma dalagi. Omiyo tim mar ngʼanyo nomedo bedo gi teko, kendo ji mane luwo bangʼ Abisalom nosiko ka medore.<verse eid="2SA 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oringo odhi pondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13"/>Jaote nobiro mowachone Daudi niya, “Chuny jo-Israel nigi Abisalom.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14"/>Eka Daudi nowachone jodonge duto mane ni kode Jerusalem niya, “Biuru! Nyaka to waring waa ka, ka ok kamano onge ngʼato kuomwa mabiro tony e lwet Abisalom. Nyaka wawuog mapiyo, nono to enobi mapiyo mojukwa mi otiekwa kendo oneg ji e dala maduongʼ gi ligangla.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15"/>Jodong ruoth nodwoke niya, “Jotiji to oikore mar timo gimoro amora ma ruodhwa ma en ruoth oyiero.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16"/>Ruoth nowuok kaachiel gi joode duto makmana monde mamoko apar ema ne oweyo karito dala ruoth. <verse eid="2SA 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17"/>Omiyo ruoth nowuok kaachiel gi ji duto kaluwo bangʼe, negidhi ma gichungʼ matin kamoro mochwalore. <verse eid="2SA 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18"/>Joge duto nowuotho mokadho ka gin kaachiel gi jo-Kereth duto kod jo-Peleth; to gi jo-Giti duto mia auchiel mane obiro kode koa Gath bende ne wuotho e nyim ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19"/>Ruoth nowachone Itai ja-Giti niya, “Angʼo momiyo idhi kodwa? Dogi mondo ibed gi Ruoth Abisalom. In ngʼama wendo, moringo koa e pinygi. <verse eid="2SA 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20"/>Yande eka ibiro ka. To koro tinendeni ere kaka diwuoth kodwa kamoro amora, to an akia kuma adhiye? Dogi mondo ikaw jothuru idhigo. Mad ngʼwono gi adieri bed kodi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21"/>To Itai nodwoko ruoth niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima kendo akwongʼora ni ruodha ma en ruoth ni kamoro amora ma ruodha ma en ruoth nobedie, bed ni en kar ngima kata kar tho, to kanyo bende ema jatichni nobedie.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22"/>Daudi nowachone Itai niya, “Wuoth wadhi.” Omiyo Itai ja-Giti nowuotho gi joge duto gi joutegi mane ni kode.<verse eid="2SA 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23"/>Ji duto mane ni kama gikadhoe noywak matek ka jogo duto kadho. Ruoth bende ne ongʼado Holo mar Kidron kendo ji duto nowuotho kochomo yo thim.<verse eid="2SA 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24"/>Zadok bende ne ni kanyo to gi jo-Lawi duto mane ni kode notingʼo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Nyasaye. Negiketo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Nyasaye piny, eka Abiathar nochiwo misengini nyaka ji duto notieko wuok e dala maduongʼ.<verse eid="2SA 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25"/>Eka ruoth nowachone Zadok niya, “Dwok Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye e dala maduongʼ. Ka Jehova Nyasaye okecha, to enoduoga ka kendo enomi ane Sandug Muma kod kar dak Nyasaye kendo. <verse eid="2SA 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26"/>To kowacho ni, ‘Ok amor kodi,’ to aikora; we mondo otim gima oneno ni berne.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27"/>Ruoth nomedo wacho ni Zadok jadolo niya, “Donge in janen? Dogi dala gi kwe, gi wuodi ma Ahimaz gi Jonathan wuod Abiathar. In kod Abiathar kawuru yawuotu ariyo udhigo. <verse eid="2SA 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28"/>Abiro rito kama iyoroe aora e thim nyaka ayud wach moa iri kinyisago gima dhi nyime. <verse eid="2SA 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29"/>Omiyo Zadok gi Abiathar nodwoko Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye Jerusalem ma gibet kanyo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30"/>To Daudi nomedo wuotho ka twenyo got mar Zeituni kowuotho gi tiende nono, koumo wiye kendo oywak. Ji duto mane ni kode bende noumo wigi, to gin bende ne giywak ka gitwenyo got. <verse eid="2SA 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31"/>Nonwangʼo ka Daudi osenyisi niya, “Ahithofel en achiel kuom jo-andhoga mane oriwore gi Abisalom.” Omiyo Daudi nolemo niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, lok ngʼado rieko mar Ahithofel obed fuwo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32"/>Kane Daudi ochopo ewi got kuma ji ne lamoe Nyasaye chon, Hushai ja-Arki ne ni kanyo mondo orom kode, lawe ne oyiech kendo buru ne ni e wiye. <verse eid="2SA 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33"/>Daudi nowachone niya, “Kidhi koda to idhi bedona tingʼ mapek. <verse eid="2SA 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34"/>To kidok e dala maduongʼ miwachone Abisalom ni, ‘Abiro bedo jatiji, yaye ruoth; nikech ne an jatij wuonu ndalo mokadho, to sani koro abiro bedo jatiji,’ to kitimo ma to inyalo konya ketho ngʼado rieko mar Ahithofel. <verse eid="2SA 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35"/>Donge jodolo ma gin Zadok gi Abiathar jodhi bedo kodi kuno? Wachnegi gimoro amora miwinjo e dala ruoth. <verse eid="2SA 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36"/>Yawuotgi ariyo ma gin Ahimaz wuod Zadok gi Jonathan wuod Abiathar bende ni kanyo kodgi. Orgi ira gi gimoro amora miwinjo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37"/>Omiyo osiep Daudi ma Hushai nochopo Jerusalem e sa mane Abisalom donjoe e dala maduongʼ.<verse eid="2SA 15:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi gi Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1"/>Kane Daudi osewuotho matin koa ewi got, noyudo Ziba jarit mwandu mag Mefibosheth, karite mondo oromne. Ne osembo punde bwora motingʼo makati mia ariyo, gi olemb mzabibu mongʼin mag makati mia achiel gi olemb ngʼowu mongʼin bende mia achiel kod divai mool e dende.<verse eid="2SA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2"/>Ruoth nopenjo Ziba niya, “Angʼo momiyo ikelo gigi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Ziba nodwoke niya, “Pundegi gin ma jood ruoth nyalo idho, makati gi olembe to gin mar jogi mondo ocham, divai to en mar duogo chuny joma ool e thim mondo omadhi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3"/>Eka ruoth nopenje niya, “To ere nyakwar ruodhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ziba nowachone niya, “Odongʼ Jerusalem, nikech oparo ni, ‘Kawuononi jo-Israel dhi dwokona loch kwara.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4"/>Eka ruoth nowachone Ziba niya, “Gik moko duto ma mag Mefibosheth koro gin magi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ziba nowachone niya, “Erokamano. Mad ayud ngʼwono e wangʼ ruodha ma en ruoth.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shimei okwongʼo Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5"/>Ka ruoth Daudi nochimo Bahurim, ngʼat moro moa e dhoodgi Saulo nobiro koa kuno. Nyinge ne Shimei wuod Gera, nowuok kowacho weche mag kwongʼ. <verse eid="2SA 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6"/>Nobayo Daudi gi jodong ruoth gi kite, kata obedo ni jolweny gi thuondi ne ogengʼo bath Daudi korachwich gi koracham. <verse eid="2SA 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7"/>Shimei nokwongʼe kawacho niya, “Wuog idhi, wuog idhi in ngʼat mosechwero remo, kendo mofuwoni. <verse eid="2SA 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8"/>Jehova Nyasaye osechuli kuom remo duto mane ichwero e dhood Saulo, ma isetiyo kar lochne. Jehova Nyasaye osemiyo wuodi Abisalom pinyruoth. Osetieki nikech in dhano mohero chwero remo.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9"/>Eka Abishai wuod Zeruya nowachone ruoth niya, “Guok mothoni to kwongʼo ruodha nangʼo? We adhi angʼad ngʼute oko.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10"/>To ruoth nodwoke niya, “Angʼo machandou koda un yawuot Zeruya? Ka okwongʼa nikech Jehova Nyasaye nowachone ni, ‘Kwongʼ Daudi,’ to en ngʼa madipenj ni, ‘Angʼo momiyo itimo kama?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11"/>Daudi nowachone Abishai gi jodonge duto niya, “Ka wuoda, manywolo ema dwaro tieko ngimana, to kare ja-Benjamin-ni ditimna marach maromo nade! Wereuru kode odhi nyime gi kwongʼ nimar Jehova Nyasaye osenyise mondo otim kamano. <verse eid="2SA 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12"/>Dipo ka Jehova Nyasaye oneno midhiero ma an-go motimona ngʼwono kar kwongʼ mayudo kawuononi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13"/>Omiyo Daudi gi joge nomedo wuotho kadhi nyime ka giluwo yo, ka Shimei bende ne wuotho e dir got mochimore kode ka odhi nyime gi kwongʼe to obaye gi kite kokiro gik mochido kuome. <verse eid="2SA 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14"/>Ruoth gi ji duto mane ni kode nochopo kama negidhiyoe ka giol. Kendo noyweyo kanyo.<verse eid="2SA 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hushai gi Ahithofel ongʼadone Abisalom rieko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15"/>To gi e kindeno, Abisalom gi jo-Israel nobiro Jerusalem to Ahithofel ne ni kode. <verse eid="2SA 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16"/>Eka Hushai ja-Arki, mosiep Daudi nodhi ir Abisalom mowachone niya, “Ruoth mondo odag amingʼa! Ruoth mondo odag amingʼa!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17"/>Abisalom nopenjo Hushai niya, “Ma e kaka inyiso hera ne osiepni? Marangʼo ne ok idhi gosiepni?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18"/>Hushai nowachone Abisalom niya, “Ooyo to mana ngʼat moyier gi Jehova Nyasaye, moyier gi jogi to gi jo-Israel duto mano e ngʼat mabiro bedo jakore mi asik kode. <verse eid="2SA 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19"/>To moloyo kanyo, kare onego atine ngʼa? Donge onego atine wuode? Mana kaka natiyo ni wuonu, e kaka in bende abiro tiyoni.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20"/>Abisalom nowachone Ahithofel niya, “Ngʼadnwae rieko. En angʼo monego watim?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21"/>Ahithofel nodwoke niya, “Terri gi monde wuonu mamoko mane oweyo karito dala ruoth. Eka jo-Israel nowinj kaka isebedo mangʼwe e um wuonu, kendo ji duto man kodi nobed gi teko.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22"/>Omiyo negiguro hema ne Abisalom ewi ot malo kendo noterore gi monde wuon-gi mamoko mana ka jo-Israel duto neno.<verse eid="2SA 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23"/>E ndalono rieko mane Ahithofel ngʼado nechalo mana ka ngʼat mopenjo Nyasaye wach. Mano e kaka Daudi gi Abisalom ne okawo rieko ma Ahithofel ne chiwo.<verse eid="2SA 16:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1"/>Ahithofel nowachone Abisalom niya, “Kane bed ni an in, to dine ayiero ji alufu apar gariyo kendo awuokgo otieno ma kawuononi mondo alaw Daudi; <verse eid="2SA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2"/>mi amonje kapod ool kendo onyosore. Anami kihondko malich make mi ji duto man kode ring weye. Daneg mana ruoth kende <verse eid="2SA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3"/>eka aduog ji duto iri. Ka ngʼat midwaro ngimaneni otho; to ji duto noduog maonge ngʼama nohinyre.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4"/>Wachni ne nenore ni ber ne Abisalom gi jodong Israel duto.<verse eid="2SA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5"/>To Abisalom nowacho niya, “Luonguru Hushai ja-Arki, mondo en bende wawinj gima owacho.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6"/>Kane Hushai osebiro ire, Abisalom nowacho niya, “Ma e rieko mane Ahithofel osengʼado. Owinjore watim kamano koso? To ka ok kamano to kare nyiswa ane kaka iparo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7"/>Hushai nodwoko Abisalom niya, “Rieko ma Ahithofel ongʼado kawuononi ok ber. <verse eid="2SA 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8"/>Ingʼeyo ni wuonu gi joge gin jolweny, bende gin joma ger mana ka ondiek moma nyithinde. Bende nyaka ingʼe ni wuonu en jalweny mongʼith; ok obi nindo kama jolweny nindoe. <verse eid="2SA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9"/>Kata mana sani koro osepondo e bur moro kata mana kamachielo; kipo ni en ema okwongo omonjo jogi, ngʼato angʼata mowinjo wachno biro wacho ni, ‘Oseneg jolweny mag Abisalom.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10"/>Kata mana jalweny ma jachir ma chunye chalo gi chuny sibuor, biro kirni ka luoro ohewe, nimar Israel duto ongʼeyo wuonu ni en jalweny kendo ni ji man kode gin jochir.<verse eid="2SA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11"/>“Kuom mano an angʼadoni rieko kama: Chok jo-Israel duto, chakre Dan nyaka Bersheba gin joma ngʼeny ka kwoyo man e dho nam, to in mondo itel nyimgi ka ukedo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12"/>Eka wanamonje kamoro amora minyalo yude kendo wanapodh kuome mana ka thoo momoko e lum maonge ngʼato kuomgi kata achiel manowe kangima. <verse eid="2SA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13"/>Kaponi odhi mopondo e dala moro, to jo-Israel duto nokel tonde e dalano kendo wanaywa ohinga mar dalano mi wamuke kwatere e holo ma kata mana bathe matin ok noyudi.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14"/>Abisalom kod ji duto mag Israel nowacho niya, “Rieko mar Hushai ja-Arki ber moloyo mar Ahithofel.” Nimar Jehova Nyasaye noramo ni nyaka oroch rieko maber mane Ahithofel ongʼado mondo okelni Abisalom masira.<verse eid="2SA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15"/>Hushai nonyiso Zadok gi Abiathar, ma jodolo niya, “Ahithofel osengʼado rieko ni Abisalom gi jodong Israel mondo otim ma gi macha, to an bende asengʼado rieko mondo gitim mana kama. <verse eid="2SA 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16"/>Koro oruru wach piyo piyo mondo unyis Daudi ni, ‘Kik inindi e dho wath manie thim; to nyaka ingʼadi idhi loka machielo nono to ruoth gi joma ni kode notieki.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17"/>Jonathan gi Ahimaz ne ni En Rogel. Nyako moro ma jatich ne onego ternegi wach, to gin ne giterone ruoth Daudi nikech ne ok gidwar ni ngʼato onegi ka gidonjo e dala maduongʼno. <verse eid="2SA 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18"/>To kata kamano rawera moro nonenogi mowacho ni Abisalom. Omiyo ji ariyogi nowuok piyo kendo negidhi Bahurim e od ngʼat moro. Ne en gi soko e laru mare, kendo negidonjo e iye. <verse eid="2SA 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19"/>Chi ngʼatno nokawo gimoro ma oumogo soko bangʼe ne omoyo cham e wiye. To onge ngʼama nofwenyo sokono.<verse eid="2SA 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20"/>Kane jo-Abisalom obiro e od dhakoni, negipenje niya, “Ere Ahimaz gi Jonathan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Dhakono nodwoko niya, “Ne gisengʼado aora.” Jogi nodwero to ne ok giyudo ngʼato, mine gidok Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21"/>Ka jogo nosedhi, ji ariyogi nowuok e soko mi gidhi gitero ni ruoth Daudi wach. Negiwachone niya, “Wuogi ingʼad aora piyo, Ahithofel osengʼado rieko machal kama kuomi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22"/>Omiyo Daudi gi ji duto mane ni kode nowuok mongʼado aora Jordan. Kane piny yawore to ne onge ngʼat modongʼ kapok ongʼado Jordan.<verse eid="2SA 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23"/>Kane Ahithofel oneno ni rieko mane ongʼado ok oluw, noidho pundane modok dalagi e ode. Noloso weche mag ode; bangʼe ne odere. Omiyo notho moike e bur wuon mare.<verse eid="2SA 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Abisalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24"/>Daudi nodhi Mahanaim, to Abisalom nongʼado aora Jordan kod jo-Israel duto. <verse eid="2SA 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25"/>Abisalom noseketo Amasa mondo otel ni jolweny kar Joab. Amasa ne wuod ngʼat moro miluongo ni Jetha, ja-Israel mane okendo Abigael, nyar Nahash mane nyamin Zeruya ma min Joab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26"/>Jo-Israel gi Abisalom nojot e piny Gilead.<verse eid="2SA 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27"/>Kane Daudi obiro Mahanaim, Shobi wuod Nahash maa Raba e piny jo-Amon, gi Makir wuod Amiel maa Lo Debar, gi Barzilai ma ja-Gilead maa Rogelim, <verse eid="2SA 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28"/>nokelo gige nindo gi bakunde to gi gik mochwe gi lowo. Bende negikelo ngano gi shairi, mogo gi cham molodi, oganda gi ngʼor, <verse eid="2SA 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29"/>mor kich gi chak mopoto, rombe, cha dhiangʼ mopoto mongʼin ni Daudi gi joge mondo ocham. Nimar negiwacho niya, “Jogi osebedo mool kendo riyo ohewogi e thim.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1"/>Daudi nochano joma ne ni kode kendo noyieronigi jotend lweny mag alufe to gi mag miche. <verse eid="2SA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2"/>Daudi nooro migepe adek mag jolweny: mokwongo notelne gi Joab, mar ariyo notelne gi Abishai ma owadgi Joab wuod Zeruya, mar adek notelne gi Itai ja-Giti. To ruoth nowachone migepego niya, “An bende nyaka adhi kodu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3"/>To jogo nowachone niya, “In ok inyal dhi kodwa, nikech ka ochuno ni nyaka waringi, to ok gibi dewowa. Kata ka nuswa otho to ok gidhi dewo nikech in iromri gi ji alufu apar kuomwa. Omiyo ber ka in idongʼ mondo ikonywa gie dala maduongʼ ka.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4"/>Ruoth nodwoko niya, “Abiro timo gima uneno ni bernu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Omiyo ruoth nochungʼ but rangach sa ma ne oganda lweny duto ne wuok e migepegi mag miche gi mag alufe. <verse eid="2SA 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5"/>Ruoth nochiko Joab gi Abishai kod Itai niya, “Beduru mangʼwon ne wuoda Abisalom nikech an.” Oganda duto mag jolweny nowinjo ka ruoth chiko jotelo ni kik gihiny Abisalom.<verse eid="2SA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6"/>Jolweny nowuok modhi e paw lweny mondo giked gi Israel, kendo lweny nogore e bungu mar Efraim. <verse eid="2SA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7"/>Jolwenj mag Daudi noloyo jo-Israel kanyo, kendo ji mane otho ne ngʼeny maloyo ji alufu piero ariyo. <verse eid="2SA 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8"/>Lweny nolandore mokwako piny, kendo joma notho chiengʼno e bungu ne ngʼeny moloyo joma noneg gi ligangla.<verse eid="2SA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9"/>Koro Abisalom nopo koromo gi jolwenj Daudi koidho pundane. To kane oyudo kanyna kadho e bwo yiend ober man-gi tipo malach, wi Abisalom nomoko e bad yadhno, mi nodongʼ koliero e kor yamo, ka kanyna mane oidho to ne dhiyo nyime gi wuoth.<verse eid="2SA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10"/>Kane achiel kuom jogo noneno ma, nonyiso Joab niya, “Aneno Abisalom koliero e bad yiend ober.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11"/>Joab nowacho ni ngʼat mane onyise wachno niya, “Angʼo! Inene? Angʼo ma nomoni chwowe molwar piny kanyo? To damiyi shekel apar mag fedha gi okanda mar jolweny.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12"/>To ngʼatno nodwoke niya, “Kata dine unyalo pimo shekel alufu achiel moket e lweta, anto ok datingʼ lweta mondo aket kuom wuod ruoth. Ne wawinjo gi itwa ka ruoth chiko in gi Abishai kod Itai ni, ‘Rituru wuoda Abisalom nikech an.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13"/>To ka dine atim mano, to dine aketo ngimana e chandruok nikech onge gima opondo ne ruoth bende dine ok ikonya.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14"/>Joab nowacho niya, “Anto ok abi rito kamano.” Ka Abisalom ne pod oliero e bad yiend ober kangima, nokawo tonge adek e lwete mochwoyo dho chuny Abisalom. <verse eid="2SA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15"/>Kendo ji apar matingʼo gige lweny mag Joab nolworo Abisalom, negigoye, ma ginege.<verse eid="2SA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16"/>Eka Joab nogoyo turumbete mi jolweny noweyo lawo jo-Israel nikech Joab nokwerogi. <verse eid="2SA 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17"/>Negikawo Abisalom ma giwito e bugo maduongʼ manie bungu, mi gibiwo kite madongo dongo kuome. E kindeno jo-Israel duto noringo modhi e miechgi.<verse eid="2SA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18"/>Ka Abisalom ne pod ngima nokawo siro mochungo e Holo mar Ruoth kaka rapar mare owuon nimar noparo niya, “Aonge wuowi manyalo tingʼo wiya malo kata ma dichaka.” Nochako sirono nyinge owuon, mi oluonge ni Rapar mar Abisalom nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="2SA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oywak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19"/>Koro Ahimaz wuod Zadok nowacho niya, “We aring ater wachni ne ruoth ni Jehova Nyasaye oserese e lwet jowasike.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20"/>Joab nowachone niya, “In ok niter wach kawuono. Inyalo mana tero wach chiengʼ machielo, nikech wuod ruoth otho.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21"/>Eka Joab nowachone ja-Kush niya, “Dhiyo mondo inyis ruoth gima ineno.” Ja-Kush nokulore piny e nyim Joab bangʼe noringo modhi.<verse eid="2SA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22"/>Ahimaz wuod Zadok nochako wacho ne Joab niya, “Kata bed ni angʼo matimore, to yiena alaw ja-Kush.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">To Joab nodwoke niya, “Wuoda, angʼo momiyo idwaro dhi? Ionge gi wach maber manyalo keloni mich.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23"/>En to nowacho niya, “Kata angʼo matimore, to nyaka aring adhi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Omiyo Joab nowachone niya, “Ringi idhi.” Eka Ahimaz noringo odhi koluwo yor pap moyombo ja-Kush.<verse eid="2SA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24"/>Kane oyudo Daudi obet e kind rangach maiye gi ma oko, jarito noidho wi dhoranga ohinga mar ngʼicho. Kane ongʼiyo oko, noneno ngʼato karingo kende. <verse eid="2SA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25"/>Jarito noluongo ruoth monyise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">To ruoth nowacho niya, “Ka en kende to nyaka bed ni en gi wach maber.” Kendo ngʼatno nomedo sudo machiegni koringo.<verse eid="2SA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26"/>Eka jarito noneno ngʼat machielo karingo, kendo noluongo jarit dhorangach mowachone niya, “Ne ngʼat machielo bende ringo biro ka en kende!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">To ruoth nowacho niya, “En bende nyaka bed ni okelo wach maber.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27"/>Jarito nowacho niya, “Nenorena ni ngʼat mokwongo ringo ka Ahimaz wuod Zadok.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Ruoth nowacho niya, “En ngʼat maber. Obiro gi wach maber.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28"/>Eka Ahimaz nowuoyo gi ruoth kowacho niya, “Gik moko dhi maber!” Nopodho piny auma e nyim ruoth ka wangʼe ochomo piny mi owacho niya, “Pak obed ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi! Osechiwo e lwet ruodha ma en ruoth jogo mosepiem kode.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29"/>Ruoth nopenjo niya, “Bende wuowi ma Abisalom ngima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaz nodwoke niya, “Ne aneno ka mutni nitie maduongʼ e sa ma Joab ne oro jatich ruoth kod an, jatichni, to ok angʼeyo gima ne timore.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30"/>To ruoth nowachone niya, “Chungʼ e bathe ka kendo iriti.” Omiyo nosudo bathe mochungʼ kanyo.<verse eid="2SA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31"/>Eka ja-Kush nochopo mowacho niya, “Ruodha ma en ruoth, winj wach maber! Jehova Nyasaye oseresi kawuononi e lwet joma piem kodi duto.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32"/>Ruoth nopenjo ja-Kush niya, “Bende wuowi ma Abisalom ngima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Ja-Kush nodwoko niya, “Mad wasigu mag ruodha ma en ruoth gi ji duto mane ongʼanyo ka dwahinyi obed kaka wuowino.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33"/>Ruoth nobwok motetni. Noidho malo e ot man ewi rangach mi oywak. Noywak kowacho niya, “Yaye wuoda Abisalom, wuoda, wuoda Abisalom! Onego an ema ne atho kari, yaye Abisalom wuoda, wuoda!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1"/>Nowach ne Joab niya, “Ruoth dengo malit kaywago Abisalom.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2"/>Loch machiengʼno nolokore ywak ni jolweny, nikech migepe mag jolweny, nowinjo kiwacho niya, “Ruoth okuyo nikech tho wuode.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3"/>Ji nodonjo lingʼ-lingʼ e dala maduongʼ chiengʼno mana kaka joma oloo e lweny duogo alucha ka wigi okuot. <verse eid="2SA 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4"/>To ruoth noumo wangʼe, koywak matek niya, “Yaye Abisalom wuoda! Yaye Abisalom wuoda, wuoda!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5"/>Eka Joab nodhi ei ot ir ruoth mowacho niya, “Kawuononi isekuodo wi jogi duto, ma osereso ngimani, ngima yawuoti gi nyigi to gi ngima mondi to gi mondi mamoko. <verse eid="2SA 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6"/>Ihero joma ochayi to ichayo joma oheri. Kawuono inyiso ratiro ni jotend lweny gi jolwenygi ok gimoro e nyimi. Aneno ni dine imor ka Abisalom ngima kawuono to wan duto ne watho. <verse eid="2SA 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7"/>Koro wuogi oko mondo iho jogi. An gadiera e nying Jehova Nyasaye ni ka ok iwuok oko, to otieno ma kawuono onge kata mana ngʼato achiel ma biro bedo kodi. Mano nobedni masira maduongʼ moloyo masiche duto miseneno nyaka ia e nyathi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8"/>Omiyo ruoth nochungʼ modhi obet e kome e dhorangach. Eka nonyis jolweny ni, Ruoth obet e dhorangach, kendo giduto negibiro mi gichungʼ e nyime.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Koro nonwangʼo ka jo-Israel noseringo odhi e miechgi.<verse eid="2SA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi odok Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9"/>Ji ne mino wach kendgi e dhout Israel duto kagiwacho niya, “Ruoth noresowa e lwet wasikwa; en ema noresowa e lwet jo-Filistia. To koro sani oseringo oa e pinywani nikech wach Abisalom; <verse eid="2SA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10"/>kendo Abisalom mane wawiro mondo obed ruodhwa bende osetho e lweny. Mara angʼo ulingʼ alingʼa ma ok uwuo e wach mar duogo ruoth?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11"/>Ruoth Daudi nooro wachni ne Zadok gi Abiathar, ma jodolo kama: “Penjuru jodong Juda ni, ‘Angʼo momiyo dudongʼ chien kuom dwoko ruoth dalane, nimar weche mane iwacho e Israel duto osechopo ni ruoth e kar dakne? <verse eid="2SA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12"/>Un e owetena kendo une remba. Marangʼo un ema dudongʼ chien kuom duogo ruoth?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13"/>Kendo wachne Amasa ni, ‘Donge in wadwa ma remba? Mad Nyasaye kuma malit ahinya ka dipo ni ok aketi jatend jolweny sani kar Joab.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14"/>Ne oloko pach jo-Juda duto mane gibedo gi paro achiel. Ne giorone ruoth wach niya, “Duogi gi jogi duto.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15"/>Eka ruoth nodok mochopo nyaka Jordan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Nonwangʼo ka jo-Juda osebiro Gilgal mondo gidhi giromne ruoth kendo gingʼad kode aora Jordan. <verse eid="2SA 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16"/>Shimei wuod Gera, ja-Benjamin moa Bahurim, noreto kolor piny kaachiel gi jo-Juda mondo girom ni Ruoth Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17"/>Jo-Benjamin alufu achiel ne ni kode, kaachiel Ziba, ma jatend jorit mwandu mar od Saulo, to gi yawuote apar gabich kod jotije piero ariyo. Negireto ka gidhi Jordan, kuma ruoth ne nitie. <verse eid="2SA 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18"/>Negingʼado kar dho wath mondo gikaw ruoth gi joode mane ni loka kendo gitim gimoro amora modwaro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Kane Shimei wuod Gera nongʼado Jordan, nopodho auma e nyim ruoth <verse eid="2SA 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19"/>mowachone niya, “Mad ruodha kik kwana ka jaketho. Kik ipar kaka jatichni notimo marach chiengʼ ma ruodha ma en ruoth nowuok Jerusalem. Mad ruoth wiye wil. <verse eid="2SA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20"/>Nimar an jatichni angʼeyo nine atimo richo, to koro asebiro kaka ngʼat mokwongo moa e dhood Josef mosebiro mwalo ka mondo aromni ruodha ma en ruoth?”<verse eid="2SA 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21"/>Eka Abishai wuod Zeruya nowacho niya, “Donge Shimei onego neg nikech ma? Nokwongʼo ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22"/>Daudi nodwoko niya, “Angʼo machandou koda un yawuot Zeruya? Kawuono usedoko jowasika! Bende onego neg ngʼato e Israel kawuono? Donge angʼeyo ni an ruoth e Israel kawuono?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23"/>Omiyo nowacho ni Shimei niya, “Ok ibi tho.” Kendo ruoth nosingore kokwongʼore.<verse eid="2SA 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24"/>Mefibosheth, nyakwar Saulo bende nodhi mondo orom ne ruoth. Ne pok olwoko tiende kata buso yie tike kendo luoko lepe chakre chiengʼ mane ruoth owuokie nyaka chiengʼ manoduogo ka ok ohinyore. <verse eid="2SA 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25"/>Kane obiro koa Jerusalem mondo orom ne ruoth, ruoth nopenjo Mefibosheth niya, “Angʼo mane omoni dhi koda?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26"/>Nodwoke niya, “Ruodha ma en ruoth, nikech jatichni en rangʼol, ne awacho ni, ‘Abiro ikoni pundana mondo otingʼa adhi gi ruoth.’ To Ziba ma jatija nondhoga. <verse eid="2SA 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27"/>Kendo oseketho nying jatichni ni ruodha ma en ruoth. Ruodha ma en ruoth chal ka malaika mar Nyasaye; omiyo tim atima gima ineno ni berni. <verse eid="2SA 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28"/>Anywolana duto ne ok onego gen gimoro moa kuom ruodha ma en ruoth makmana tho, to ne imiyo jatichni obet kod jogo machiemo e mesani. En ratiro mane ma an-go madimi amed keto kwayona ni ruoth?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29"/>Ruoth nowachone niya, “Angʼo ma dimi imed wuoyo? Asemiyou chik ni in kod Ziba upogru puothe.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30"/>Mefibosheth nowachone ruoth niya, “Makoro ruodha ma en ruoth osedwogo dala ma ok ohinyore, weye okaw gigo duto.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31"/>Barzilai ja-Gilead bende nobiro koa Rogelim mondo ongʼad Jordan gi ruoth kendo okowe oweye kodhi. <verse eid="2SA 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32"/>Koro Barzilai ne en jaduongʼ moti ahinya, ma hike ne romo piero aboro. Ne okonyo ruoth gi chiemo e kinde mane en Mahanaim, nimar ne en ngʼat ma jamoko ahinya. <verse eid="2SA 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33"/>Ruoth nowacho ni Barzilai niya, “Ngʼad aora koda mondo ibi idag koda Jerusalem, kendo abiro miyi gik mikonyorigo duto.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34"/>To Barzilai nodwoko ruoth niya, “Aseti, pod abiro dak higni adi, madimi adhi gi ruoth Jerusalem? <verse eid="2SA 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35"/>Koro an ja-higni piero aboro. Bende anyalo pogo gima ber kod gima rach? Bende jatichni diwinj ndhath gima ochamo kod momadho? Bende pod dawinj dwond chwo gi mon ma jower? Angʼo ma dimi jatichni dimed tingʼ matin ni ruodha ma en ruoth? <verse eid="2SA 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36"/>Jatichni biro ngʼado Jordan modhi gi ruoth mochwalore matin, to en angʼo momiyo ruoth dimiya chiwo machal kama? <verse eid="2SA 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37"/>Weya adogi mondo adhi atho e dalawa but kama noyikie wuonwa gi minwa. To jatichni miluongo ni Kimham nika. Yiene mondo ongʼad odhi gi ruodha ma en ruoth loka. Timne gimoro amora mihero.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38"/>Ruoth nowacho niya, “Kimham biro ngʼado koda nyaka loka. Kendo abiro timo ne gimoro amora mihero. Bende abiro timoni gima chunyi diher mondo atimni.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39"/>Omiyo ji duto nongʼado Jordan, to bangʼe ruoth bende nongʼado loka. Ruoth nonyodho Barzilai kendo nogwedhe, eka Barzilai nodok dalane.<verse eid="2SA 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40"/>Kane ruoth ongʼado odhi loka Gilgal, Kimham nongʼado kode. Jolweny duto mag Juda gi nus mar jolweny mag Israel nokowo ruoth kuno.<verse eid="2SA 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41"/>Piyo piyo nono jo-Israel nobiro ir ruoth mi giwachone niya, “Angʼo manomiyo owetewa ma jo-Juda, kelo ruoth lingʼ-lingʼ gi joode loka aora Jordan, kaachiel gi joge duto?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42"/>Jo-Juda duto nodwoko jo-Israel niya, “Ne watimo ma nikech ruoth en watwa machiegni. Angʼo momiyo iu owangʼ. Bende wasechamo gimoro moa ka ruoth? Bende wasekawoe gimoro ni wan wawegi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43"/>Eka jo-Israel nodwoko jo-Juda duto niya, “Wan dhoudi apar e loch Daudi, to ewi mano, wan gi ratiro maduongʼ kuom Daudi moloyou. Koro angʼo momiyo ujarowa kamano? Donge wan ema ne wakwongo paro wach mar duogo ruodhwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">To kata kamano jo-Juda nobedo mager moloyo jo-Israel.<verse eid="2SA 19:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Sheba ongʼanyo ni Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1"/>To koro ne nitie ja-Benjamin machach ma nyinge Sheba wuod Bikri. Nogoyo turumbete kokok kowacho niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Waonge wat moro gi joka Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">kata gima oriwowa gi wuod Jesse!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Yaye, ja-Israel moro ka moro odog e hembe!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2"/>Omiyo jo-Israel duto noweyo Daudi mondo oluw Sheba wuod Bikri. To jo-Juda to nodongʼ gi ruodhgi ka gia Jordan nyaka gichopo Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3"/>Kane Daudi odwogo dalane Jerusalem, nokawo monde apar mamoko mane oweyo mondo orit dalane, mine oketogi e ot moro miritogie. Nomiyogi gik ma gikonyorego, to ne ok oriwore kodgi. Nolornegi e ot nyaka ne githo, ka gidak ka mon ma chwogi otho.<verse eid="2SA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4"/>Eka ruoth nowacho ni Amasa niya, “Luong jo-Juda mondo obi ira bangʼ ndalo adek, to in bende ibi ka.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5"/>Kane Amasa odhi luongo jo-Juda nokawo ndalo mangʼeny moloyo ndalo mane ruoth omiye.<verse eid="2SA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6"/>Daudi nowachone Abishai niya, “Koro Sheba wuod Bikri biro hinyowa moloyo kaka Abisalom notimo. Kaw jolwenj ruodhi mondo ilawe, ka ok kamano to onyalo yudo mier madongo mochiel mi odonjie kendo olalnwa.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7"/>Omiyo jo-Joab gi jo-Kereth gi jo-Peleth kod jolweny mathuondi duto nowuok kotelnegi gi Abishai. Ne giwuok Jerusalem mondo gilaw Sheba wuod Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8"/>Kane pod gin e lwanda maduongʼ man Gibeon, Amasa nobiro romo kodgi. Joab norwako lepe mag lweny kendo notweyo okanda e nungone mosoyoe ligangla man e olalo. Kane osudo nyime, ligangla nolwar koa e olalo.<verse eid="2SA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9"/>Joab nowachone Amasa niya, “Idhi nade owadwa?” Eka Joab nomako Amasa gi yie tike gi lwete ma korachwich ka gima odwaro mose gi nyoth. <verse eid="2SA 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10"/>To Amasa ne onge gi paro moro amora kuom ligangla mane ni e lwet Joab, kendo Joab nochwowo bund iye gi liganglano molal, mi nyimbiye noredhore piny. Amasa notho ma ok ochako ochwowe kendo. Eka Joab gi owadgi ma Abishai nolawo Sheba wuod Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11"/>Achiel kuom jo-Joab nochungʼ but Amasa mowacho niya, “Ngʼama jakor Joab; kendo moyie gi Daudi mondo oluw bangʼ Joab!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12"/>Amasa noriere piny kochadhore gi rembe e dier yo, kendo ngʼatno noneno ka jolweny duto ne chungʼ kochopo kanyo. Bende ka noneno ka ji duto chungʼ kochopo kama Amasa nothoeno, noywaye oko mar yo motere e pap moume gi law. <verse eid="2SA 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13"/>Kane Amasa osegol e yo, ji duto nodhi gi Joab mondo gilaw Sheba wuod Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14"/>Sheba nokadho e dier dhout Israel duto mochopo nyaka Abel Beth Maaka, bende nokadho e gwenge jo-Beri duto, kendo jogo nochokore kaachiel mondo oluwe. <verse eid="2SA 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15"/>Migepe duto mag jolweny mane nigi Joab nobiro molworo Sheba ka en Abel Beth Maaka. Negigoyo agengʼa ne dala maduongʼno kendo ka gichungʼ e agengʼa molworo ohinga. To e kindeno mane gitwomo ohinganano mondo gimuke, <verse eid="2SA 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16"/>dhako moro mariek mane ni e dala maduongʼno nokok matek kowacho niya, “Winjuru! Nyisuru Joab obi ka mondo alos kode.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17"/>Joab nodhi kama dhakono ne nitie, mi nopenjo niya, “In e Joab?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Nodwoke niya, “En an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Nowachone niya, “Chik iti ni gima jatichni dwaro wachoni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Joab nowacho niya, “Awinjo.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18"/>Nomedo wuoyo kowachone niya, “Chon gi lala ji ne jawacho ni, ‘Dhi Abel mondo ngʼadnie rieko,’ kendo wachno ne rumo kamano. <verse eid="2SA 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19"/>Wan joma odak gi kwe kendo ma jo-adiera e piny Israel ka. In to itemo mondo iketh dala maduongʼ man Israel. Angʼo momiyo idwaro tieko oganda Jehova Nyasaye?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20"/>Joab nodwoke niya, “Ngangʼ, ok en kamano! Mano gima ok anyal timo kendo ok anyal kethe! <verse eid="2SA 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21"/>Ngangʼ, ok en kamano! To gima timore en ni ngʼat moro miluongo ni Sheba wuod Bikri, moa e piny gode mag Efraim, ema piem gi ruoth Daudi. Omiyo miya ngʼatno kende, to abiro weyo dala maduongʼni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Dhakoni nowachone Joab niya, “Wiye ibiro dirni gi ewi ohinga.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22"/>Eka dhakono nodhi ir ji gi riekone mane ongʼadono, kendo negingʼado wi Sheba wuod Bikri mi gidiro ni Joab. Omiyo nogoyo turumbete, mi joge no-aa mi giweyo dala maduongʼno kendo moro ka moro nodok e dalane. Joab to nodok Jerusalem ir ruoth.<verse eid="2SA 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jotelo man ka Daudi</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23"/>Joab ne jatend jolweny Israel duto;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:23">ka Benaya wuod Jehoyada to ne otelo ne jolwenj jo-Kereth kod jo-Peleth.<verse eid="2SA 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24"/>Adoniram to notelo ni joma tiyo tich achuna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:24">Jehoshafat wuod Ahilud ne jandiko;<verse eid="2SA 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25"/>Sheva ne jagoro;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:25">to Zadok gi Abiathar ne jodolo.<verse eid="2SA 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26"/>To Ira ja-Jair ne jadolo mar Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Ochul kuor nikech jo-Gibeon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1"/>E ndalo loch Daudi, ne nitie kech kuom higni adek moluwore; omiyo Daudi nolamo koywak ni Jehova Nyasaye. To Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni, “Ma ne otimore nikech remo mane Saulo gi ode ochwero, nikech nonego jo-Gibeon.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2"/>Ruoth noluongo jo-Gibeon mowuoyo kodgi. To koro jo-Gibeon ne ok gin achiel kuom jo-Israel to ne gin jo-Amor ma notony, kendo jo-Israel nosekwongʼore ni biro weyogi ma ok onegogi, to Saulo kane dwaro gi chunye duto mondo jo-Israel gi jo-Juda ogurre motegno, notemo tiekogi. <verse eid="2SA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3"/>Daudi nopenjo jo-Gibeon niya, “Atimnu angʼo? Ere kaka dalos winjruok mane okethore mondo ugwedhi oganda Jehova Nyasaye?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4"/>Jo-Gibeon nodwoke niya, “Waonge ratiro mar dwaro fedha kata dhahabu kuom joka Saulo, to bende waonge gi teko mar nego jo-Israel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Eka Daudi nopenjogi niya, “Angʼo mudwaro mondo atimnu?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5"/>Ne gikwayo ruoth niya, “To kuom ngʼat mane onegowa kendo mane ochano yo mar hinyowa momiyo waserumo kendo wabedo maonge kar dak kamoro amora e Israel, <verse eid="2SA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6"/>yie imiwa nyikwaye machwo abiriyo mondo onegi kendo owegi e nyim Jehova Nyasaye e Gibea e dala Saulo ma en ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye moyier.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Omiyo ruoth nowacho niya, “Abiro miyougi.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7"/>To ruoth ne ongʼwono ma ok ochiwo Mefibosheth wuod Jonathan, ma wuod Saulo, nikech singruok mane Daudi gi Jonathan wuod Saulo otimo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="2SA 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8"/>To ruoth nokawo Armoni gi Mefibosheth ma yawuot Rizpa nyar Aiya mane onywolo ni Saulo, to gi yawuowi abich ma Merab nyar Saulo nonywolo ni Adriel wuod Barzilai, ma ja-Mehola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9"/>Nochiwogi ni jo-Gibeon mano onegogi moweyogi ewi got nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Giduto ji abiriyogo notho kanyakla kane oneg-gi e kinde mokwongʼo mag keyo, mana ka ichako kayo shairi.<verse eid="2SA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10"/>Rizpa nyar Aiya nokawo pien gugru mopedho ewi lwanda mondo obedie, chakre ndalo keyo nyaka koth nochako chue ka goyo ringre jogo. To noriembo winy mafuyo godiechiengʼ kod le mawuotho gotieno mondo kik cham ringregi. <verse eid="2SA 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11"/>Kane onyis Daudi gima Rizpa nyar Aiya mane en achiel kuom mond Saulo mamoko, nosetimo, <verse eid="2SA 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12"/>nodhi mokawo choke Saulo gi mag wuode Jonathan ka ogologi kuom oganda jo-Jabesh Gilead. Ne gisekawogi lingʼ-lingʼ koa e paw dala man Beth Shan, kuma jo-Filistia nolierogie bangʼ nego Saulo Gilboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13"/>Daudi nokelo choke Saulo gi mag wuode Jonathan koa kuno, kod choke mag joma ne oneg mowe oko nochokgi kamoro achiel.<verse eid="2SA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14"/>Negiiko choke Saulo gi mag Jonathan ma wuode e liend Kish wuon Saulo, e Zela e piny Benjamin kendo negitimo gik moko duto ma ruoth nochiko. Bangʼ mano Nyasaye nodwoko lemo mane ilamo ni piny.<verse eid="2SA 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwenje mane oked gi jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15"/>Lweny nochako bet kendo e kind jo-Filistia gi jo-Israel. Daudi nodhi gi joge mondo oked gi jo-Filistia, kendo nobedo mool. <verse eid="2SA 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16"/>To Ishbi-Benob ma en achiel kuom nyikwa Rafa, mane omanore gi tongʼ ma pek mula mane olosgo wiye ne romo kilo adek gi nus kendo ne en-gi ligangla manyien, nowacho ni obiro nego Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17"/>To Abishai wuod Zeruya nobiro moreso Daudi mi nogoyo ja-Filistia monego. Eka jolweny mag Daudi nosingorene kawacho niya, “Ok inichak iwuog kodwa kidhi e lweny, nikech dipo ka tach Israel otho.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18"/>Bangʼ kinde manok, ne nitie lweny machielo gi jo-Filistia e piny Gob. E kindeno Sibekai ma ja-Hushath nonego Saf, achiel kuom nyikwa Rafa.<verse eid="2SA 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19"/>E lweny machielo gi jo-Filistia e piny Gob Elhanan wuod Jare-Oregim ma ja-Bethlehem nonego Goliath, ja-Giti ma bond tonge chalo lodi.<verse eid="2SA 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20"/>Lweny machielo nochako owuok Gath, kama ne nitie ngʼat marabet mane nigi lith lwedo auchiel gi lith tielo auchiel koni gi koni, lith lwetene gi mag tiendene koriw to ne romo piero ariyo gangʼwen. En bende ne en nyakwar Rafa. <verse eid="2SA 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21"/>En bende kane ojaro jo-Israel to Jonathan wuod Shimea ma owadgi Daudi nonege.<verse eid="2SA 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22"/>Ji angʼwen-gi mane nyikwa Rafa ma ja-Gath, nonegi gi Daudi kod joge.<verse eid="2SA 21:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Wend Daudi mar pak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1"/>Kane Jehova Nyasaye osereso Daudi e lwet wasike duto kod e lwet Saulo, Daudi nowerne Jehova Nyasaye kopake gi weche mag wendni. <verse eid="2SA 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2"/>Nowacho ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“Jehova Nyasaye en lwandana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">en ohingana kendo en e jaresna;<verse eid="2SA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3"/>Nyasacha e lwandana, kuome ema apondoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">kendo en e okumbana kendo en e teko mar warruokna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">En e ohingana, kar pondana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">kendo jawarna en ema oresa kuom jo-mahundu.<verse eid="2SA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4"/>“Aluongo Jehova Nyasaye, mowinjore pako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">kendo oresa kuom wasika.<verse eid="2SA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5"/>Apaka mag tho nolwora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">kendo oula mar kethruok nohewa.<verse eid="2SA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6"/>Tonde mag tho nondhoga morida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">kendo obadho mar tho nochika tir.<verse eid="2SA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7"/>“E chandruokna ne aluongo Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">kendo naluongo Nyasacha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Nowinjo dwonda ka en e hekalu mare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">kendo ywakna nochopo e ite.<verse eid="2SA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8"/>Piny notetni kendo oyiengni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">mise mag polo noyiengni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">negitetni nikech nokecho.<verse eid="2SA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9"/>Iro nowuok e ume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">mach mangʼangʼni nowuokie dhoge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">mirni maliel maliet bende nowuok kuome.<verse eid="2SA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10"/>Nobaro polo mobiro e piny;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">rumbi molil ti nonyono gi tiende.<verse eid="2SA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11"/>Noidho kerubi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">mi ofuyogo ka kalausi.<verse eid="2SA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12"/>Noloso mudho obedo ka hema molwore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">ma en rumbi motwere mar koth manie polo.<verse eid="2SA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13"/>Ler nowuok kama entie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">mamil ka mil polo.<verse eid="2SA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14"/>Jehova Nyasaye nomor gie polo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">dwond Nyasaye Man Malo Moloyo nowuo.<verse eid="2SA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15"/>Nodiro aserni mokeyo wasigu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">mor polo gi mil polo noriembogi.<verse eid="2SA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16"/>Kude mag nam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">kod mise mag piny noelore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">kane Jehova Nyasaye okwerogi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">kokudho gi much ume.<verse eid="2SA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17"/>“Norieyo bade ka en malo momaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">nogola ei pige matut.<verse eid="2SA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18"/>Noresa e lwet jasika maratego,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">kuom jowasika, mane tek moloya.<verse eid="2SA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19"/>Negimonja e kinde mane an gi masira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">to Jehova Nyasaye ema nokonya.<verse eid="2SA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20"/>Nokela kama ni thuolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">noresa nikech nomor koda.<verse eid="2SA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21"/>“Jehova Nyasaye osetimona mana maromre gi timna makare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">osechula kaluwore gi tich lweta maler.<verse eid="2SA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22"/>Nimar aserito yore Jehova Nyasaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">ok asetimo marach kuom weyo Nyasacha.<verse eid="2SA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23"/>Chikene duto ni e nyima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">pok alokora aweyo buchene.<verse eid="2SA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24"/>Asebedo maonge ketho e nyime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">kendo aseritora mondo kik atim richo.<verse eid="2SA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25"/>Jehova Nyasaye osemiya pokna mowinjore gi timna makare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">mana machal gi kaka aler e wangʼe.<verse eid="2SA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26"/>“Ne jo-adiera, ibedonegi ja-adiera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">to ni joma onge ketho, to ibedonegi maonge ketho,<verse eid="2SA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27"/>ne jomaler, inyisori kaka ngʼama ler,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">to ne joma yoregi obam, inyisori kaka ngʼama rach.<verse eid="2SA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28"/>Ireso joma muol,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">to wangʼi rango josunga mondo idwokgi piny.<verse eid="2SA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29"/>In e tacha, yaye Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">Jehova Nyasaye loko mudho momaka bedo ler.<verse eid="2SA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30"/>Ka ikonya to anyalo loyo jolweny momonja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ka an gi Nyasacha to anyalo lwenyo ohinga.<verse eid="2SA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31"/>“Yor Nyasaye en yo malongʼo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">wach Jehova Nyasaye onge ketho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">En okumba ni jogo duto mopondo kuome.<verse eid="2SA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32"/>Ere Nyasaye moro makmana Jehova Nyasaye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Kendo en ngʼatno ma en Lwanda makmana Nyasachwa?<verse eid="2SA 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33"/>Nyasaye ema miya teko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">kendo omiyo yora bedo mokwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34"/>Omiyo tiendena bedo mayot ka tiende mwanda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">kendo en ema omiyo achungʼ kuonde man malo maboyo.<verse eid="2SA 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35"/>Otiego lwetena ne lweny;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">bedena nyalo ywayo atungʼ mar nyinyo.<verse eid="2SA 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36"/>Imiya okumbani mar loch;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">ikulori piny mondo imi abed maduongʼ.<verse eid="2SA 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37"/>Imiyo yo mawuothoe bedo malach,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">mondo tiendena kik ba yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38"/>“Ne alawo wasika mi atiekogi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">ne ok aweyogi nyaka negirumo.<verse eid="2SA 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39"/>Ne atiekogi chuth, mane ok ginyal chungʼ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">negipodho e tienda.<verse eid="2SA 22:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40"/>Ne imiya teko mar kedo lweny;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">ne imiyo jomamon koda kulore e nyima.<verse eid="2SA 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41"/>Ne imiyo wasika oringo kadhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">mine atieko joma ok dwara.<verse eid="2SA 22:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42"/>Ne giywak mondo okonygi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">to ne onge ngʼama ne nyalo resogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">ne giywakne Jehova Nyasaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">to ne ok odwokogi.<verse eid="2SA 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43"/>Ne agoyogi ma giregore ka buru mayom mar lowo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">nanyonogi mawuotho kuomgi ka chwodho man e yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44"/>“Iseresa e lwet jowa mane monja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">iserita kaka jatelo mar ogendini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Joma ne ok angʼeyo nobet e bwo lochna,<verse eid="2SA 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45"/>kendo jopinje mamoko biro ira kobolore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">ka awuoyo to giwinja kendo gitimo gima adwaro.<verse eid="2SA 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46"/>Negibiro ka gitetni; kendo ka chunygi ool,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">ka gia kuondegi mag pondo.<verse eid="2SA 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47"/>“Jehova Nyasaye ngima! Pak obed ne Lwandana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Duongʼ obed ni Nyasaye, ma Lwanda kendo ma Jawarna.<verse eid="2SA 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48"/>En e Nyasaye ma chulona kuor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">maketo ogendini e bwoya,<verse eid="2SA 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49"/>ma gonya e lwet wasika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Nitingʼa malo moloyo wasika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">ne iresa e lwet jo-mahundu.<verse eid="2SA 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50"/>Emomiyo anapaki e kind ogendini, yaye Jehova Nyasaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">kendo anawer wende mapako nyingi.<verse eid="2SA 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51"/>“Jehova Nyasaye kelo resruok maduongʼ ne ruoth moketo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">onyiso ngʼwonone mogundho ma ok rum ne ngʼate mowir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ni Daudi gi nyikwaye nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Weche Daudi mogik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1"/>Magi e weche Daudi mogik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Weche mag Daudi wuod Jesse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">weche ngʼat motingʼ malo gi Ngʼat Mamalo Mogik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">ngʼat mowir gi Nyasach Jakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">jawer wende mag Israel.<verse eid="2SA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2"/>Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nowuoyo kotiyo koda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">wechene ne ni e dhoga.<verse eid="2SA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3"/>Nyasach Israel nowuoyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Lwanda mar Israel nowachona ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Ka ngʼato otelo ni ji e yo makare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">kendo ka olocho koluoro Nyasaye,<verse eid="2SA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4"/>to ochalo gi ler mar okinyi ka chiengʼ wuok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">okinyi maonge boche polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">machalo gi ler polo bangʼ chue koth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">mamiyo lum loth.<verse eid="2SA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5"/>Donge oda nikare e nyim Nyasaye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Donge Osesingore koda gi singruok mochwere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">mochan kendo morit chuth?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Donge obiro kelo olemb warruokna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">kendo miya gik ma chunya dwaro duto?<verse eid="2SA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6"/>To joma richo ibiro wit tenge ka kuthe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">ma ok nyal chok gi lwedo.<verse eid="2SA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7"/>Ngʼama choko kuthe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">konyore gi gima olos gi nyinyo kata gi ragwar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">kendo wangʼogi kama ochokgie.<verse eid="2SA 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thuondi mag Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8"/>Magi e nyinge thuondi mag Daudi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Josheb-Bashebeth ja-Takemon, ne thuon kuom thuondi adek; nokawo tongʼe monegogo ji mia aboro e lweny dichiel.<verse eid="2SA 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9"/>Ngʼat maluwe ne en Eliazar wuod Dodai ma ja-Ahohi. Kaka achiel kuom thuondi adek, ne en gi Daudi kane gijaro jo-Filistia mano chokore Pas Damim ne lweny. Eka jolwenj Israel noringo, <verse eid="2SA 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10"/>to en nochungʼ kar tiende mi nonego jo-Filistia nyaka bade nojony ma lwete omoko e ligangla. Jehova Nyasaye nokelo loch maduongʼ chiengʼno, jolweny noduogo ir Eliazar to mana ni yako gige joma otho.<verse eid="2SA 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11"/>Maluwe ne en Shama wuod Agee ma ja-Harar. Kane jo-Filistia ochokore kama ne nitie puoth ngʼor, jo-Israel noringogi. <verse eid="2SA 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12"/>To Shama nochungʼ kar tiende e dier puodhono. Norite monego jo-Filistia, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nokelo loch maduongʼ.<verse eid="2SA 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13"/>E kinde mag keyo, adek kuom thuondi piero adek madongo nobiro ir Daudi e rogo man Adulam, ka jolweny mag jo-Filistia to nojot e Holo mar Refaim. <verse eid="2SA 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14"/>E kindeno Daudi nopondo e rogo kendo jo-Filistia to nochokore Bethlehem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15"/>Daudi riyo noloyo mowacho niya, “Yaye mad ne ngʼato kelnae pi soko man but ranga Bethlehem mondo amodhi!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16"/>Eka thuondi adekgo nomwomo kama jolwenj jo-Filistia nochanore mi gitwomo pi e soko mane nitie but ranga Bethlehem kendo giterone Daudi. To notamore modho pigno, to kar modhe to noologo piny e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="2SA 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17"/>Nowacho niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ok datim ma ngangʼ! Donge ma en remb joma nodhi ka ok odewo ngimagi?” Kendo Daudi ne ok omodho pigno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Mago e gik mane thuondi adekgo otimo.<verse eid="2SA 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18"/>Abishai owadgi Joab wuod Zeruya ne en thuon moloyo thuondi adekgo. Nokawo tongʼe monego ji mia adek, kendo nomiyo obedo gi huma mana kaka thuondi adek ka. <verse eid="2SA 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19"/>Donge noyudo pak mathoth moloyo thuondi adekgo? Nobedo jatendgi kata obedo nine ok en achiel kuomgi.<verse eid="2SA 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20"/>Benaya wuod Jehoyada ne jalweny mathuon moa Kabzel, notimo timbe madongo. Nonego ji ariyo mag Moab mane ger ka sibuor. Chiengʼ moro nodonjo e bur ka piny otimo pe mi onego sibuor. <verse eid="2SA 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21"/>Bende en ema nonego ja-Misri marabet. Kata nobedo ni ja-Misrino ne nigi tongʼ e lwete, Benaya nodhi kedo kode kotingʼo arungu. Noyudho tongʼ e lwet ja-Misrino monege gi tonge owuon. <verse eid="2SA 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22"/>Mago e timbe mag thuon mane Benaya wuod Jehoyada otimo, en bende ne en rahuma ka thuondi adek ka. <verse eid="2SA 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23"/>Nomiye luor maduongʼ moloyo thuondi piero adekgo, to kata kamano ne ok en achiel kuom thuondi adekgo madongo. Daudi nokete jatend jolweny mane rite.<verse eid="2SA 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24"/>Ji duto mane ni e kwan mar jolweny mathuondi piero adek ne gin:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:24"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asahel owadgi Joab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Elhanan wuod Dodo ma ja-Bethlehem,<verse eid="2SA 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25"/>Shama ja-Harod,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">gi Elika ja-Harod.<verse eid="2SA 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26"/>Helez ja-Palti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">gi Ira wuod Ikesh ma ja-Tekoa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27"/>Abiezer ma ja-Anathoth,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Sibekai ma ja-Hushath,<verse eid="2SA 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28"/>Zalmon ma ja-Ahohi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharai ma ja-Netofath,<verse eid="2SA 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29"/>Heled wuod Baana ma ja-Netofath,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">Ithai wuod Ribai mawuok Gibea e piny Benjamin,<verse eid="2SA 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30"/>Benaya ja-Pirathon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">gi Hidai moa e holo man Gash,<verse eid="2SA 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31"/>Abi-Albon ja-Arbath,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">gi Azmaveth ja-Barhum,<verse eid="2SA 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32"/>Eliaba ja-Shalbon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">gi yawuot Jashen,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Jonathan <verse eid="2SA 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33"/>wuod Shama ja-Harar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">gi Ahiam wuod Sharar ma ja-Harar,<verse eid="2SA 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34"/>Elifelet wuod Ahasbai ja-Maaka</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">gi Eliam wuod Ahithofel ja-Gilon,<verse eid="2SA 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35"/>Hezro ja-Karmel</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">gi Parai ja-Arbi.<verse eid="2SA 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36"/>Igal wuod Nathan moa Zoba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">gi Bani wuod Hagri,<verse eid="2SA 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37"/>Zelek ja-Amon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharai ja-Beeroth mane jatingʼ gige lweny mag Joab wuod Zeruya,<verse eid="2SA 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38"/>Ira ja-Ithri</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:38">gi Gareb ma ja-Ithri,<verse eid="2SA 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39"/>kod Uria ja-Hiti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 23:39">Giduto ne gin ji piero adek gabiriyo.<verse eid="2SA 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okwano jolweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1"/>Mirima nochako omako Jehova Nyasaye kod Israel omiyo nochwalo Daudi motimo gimoro madihinygi, kowachone niya, “Dhiyo mondo ikwan jo-Israel gi jo-Juda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2"/>Omiyo ruoth nowachone Joab kod jotend jolweny mane ni kode niya, “Dhiuru e dhoudi duto mag Israel kochakore Dan nyaka Bersheba mondo ukwan jolweny, eka angʼe ni gin ji adi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3"/>To Joab nodwoko ruoth niya, “Mad Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi med jolweny nyadi mia achiel ka ruodha ma en ruoth neno gi wangʼe. To en angʼo momiyo ruoth ma en ruodha didwar timo gima chal kama?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4"/>Kata kamano ruoth notamo Joab gi jotelo mag lweny; kuom mano ne giwuok e nyim ruoth mondo gidhi gikwan jolweny e Israel.<verse eid="2SA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5"/>Bangʼ kane gisengʼado aora Jordan, negibuoro machiegni gi Aroer, man yo milambo mar dala manie geng holo, eka negikadho Gad ma gidhi nyaka Jazer. <verse eid="2SA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6"/>Negidhi Gilead kod gwenge mag Tatim Hodshi, mi gikadho nyaka Dan Jaan kendo negigomo ka gichiko Sidon. <verse eid="2SA 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7"/>Bangʼe negichiko dala mochiel gohinga mar Turo kod dala duto mag jo-Hivi kod mago mag jo-Kanaan. Mogik, negidhi Bersheba man Negev e piny Juda.<verse eid="2SA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8"/>Bangʼ dweche ochiko gi ndalo piero ariyo kane gisewuotho e piny duto, negidwogo Jerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9"/>Joab nokelo ne ruoth kar kwan jolweny kama: Kuom jo-Israel ne nitie ji alufu mia aboro maroteke mane nyalo kedo gi ligangla to kuom jo-Juda ne nitie ji alufu mia abich.<verse eid="2SA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10"/>Daudi chunye nochandore bangʼ kane osekwano jolweny, mi nowachone Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Asetimo richo maduongʼ kuom gima asetimoni. Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, akwayi mondo igol richoni kuom jatichni, nimar asetimo gima ofuwo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11"/>Kane Daudi pok ochiewo kinyne gokinyi, wach Jehova Nyasaye nosebiro ne Gad janabi, mane en jakor wach mar Daudi: <verse eid="2SA 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12"/>“Dhiyo iwach ni Daudi ni, ‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: Aketo weche adek e nyimi, yier achiel kuomgi monego atimni.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13"/>Omiyo Gad nodhi ir Daudi mowachone niya, “Diyier mondo kech omak piny kuom higni adek? Koso diyier dweche adek kiringo wasiki malawi? Koso diyier ndalo adek mag masira? Koro par ane mondo imiya dwoko matero ni ngʼama ne oora.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14"/>Daudi nodwoko Gad niya, “An-gi chuny lit ahinya. Ber mondo alwar e lwet Jehova Nyasaye, nikech ngʼwonone duongʼ, to kik iweya alwar e lwet ji.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nokelo masira kuom jo-Israel chakre okinyino nyaka kinde mane oketi norumo, kendo ji alufu piero abiriyo notho chakre Dan nyaka Bersheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16"/>To kane malaika orieyo bade mondo oketh Jerusalem, chuny Jehova Nyasaye ne lit nikech masirano mi nowacho ni malaika mane nego ji niya, “Oromo! Dwok lweti piny.” Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye noyudo ochungʼ e kar dino cham mar Arauna ja-Jebus.<verse eid="2SA 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17"/>Kane Daudi oneno malaika mane nego ji, nowachone Jehova Nyasaye niya, “An ema asetimo richo kendo aseketho. Magi to mana rombe, angʼo magiseketho? Akwayi ni an ema ikuma kaachiel gi joga to kik iwe masira odongʼ kuom jogi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ogero kendo mar misango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18"/>Chiengʼno Gad nodhi ir Daudi mowachone niya, “Dhi malo mondo iger kendo mar misango ni Jehova Nyasaye e laru mar dino mar Arauna ja-Jebus.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19"/>Omiyo Daudi nodhi malo mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosechike kokadho kuom Gad. <verse eid="2SA 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20"/>Kane Arauna ogoyo wangʼe moneno ruoth gi joge kabiro ire, nowuok mokulore e nyim ruoth nyaka e lowo.<verse eid="2SA 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21"/>Arauna nopenje niya, “Angʼo mokelo ruodha ma en ruoth ir jatichne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daudi nodwoke niya, “Abiro ngʼiewo laru mar dino cham, mondo agerie kendo mar misango ni Jehova Nyasaye, eka tho manego ji orum.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22"/>Arauna nowacho ne Daudi niya, “We ruodha ma en ruoth okawe kendo otim kode gima chunye dwaro mondo otimgo misango. Rwedhi mag timo misango miwangʼo pep kod yiend dino kaachiel gi jok minyalo tigo kaka yien nika. <verse eid="2SA 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23"/>Gigi duto, yaye ruoth, Arauna ema osechiwo ne ruoth.” Arauna nomedo wachone niya, “Mad Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi yie kodi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24"/>To ruoth nodwoko Arauna niya, “Ooyo, nyaka achuli. Ok abi timo ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha misango miwangʼo pep gi gik mayudo nono.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Omiyo Daudi nochulo fedha madirom nus kilo kongʼiewogo laru mar dino kaachiel gi rwedhi. <verse eid="2SA 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25"/>Daudi nogero kendo mar misango ni Jehova Nyasaye kanyo kendo nochiwo misengini miwangʼo pep kaachiel misengini mag lalruok. Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowinjo lamo mane olemogo ni piny, kendo nogengʼo masira mane ni e piny Israel.<verse eid="2SA 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24"/>
</usx>
